<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz an timi ramah mi pakhat a rak um ih a hmin cu Job a si. Job cu Pathian betu le a rinsan zettu a si. Amah cu miṭhazet a si ih thil ṭha lo zianghman tuah a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fapa pasarih le fanu pathum a neih ih tlunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuu thawng sarih, kalauk thawng thum, caw thawng khat le laak zanga a nei. Hnenum tampi tla a nei ih Nisuahnak lam hmuahhmuah ah milian bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fapa pawl cun a haha tein rawl ei puai an tuah ṭheu ih hmun khatah rawl an ei khawm ṭheu; an farnu pawl tla an sawm ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An puai a cem tikah a thaizing zingpitah Job cu a tho ih a faate pawl thianfaiternak ah thawinak a pe ṭheu. Tumtah hrimnak um loin Pathian an hmuhsuam ding ih an sual pang ding ti a phan ruangah cuticun a tuah ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah vanmi pawl an ra suah ni a thlen tikah Satan khal cu an hnenah a tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Khuilam inso na rat?” tiah Satan cu a sut. Satan in, “Leilung pumpuluk, suk le so ka vahnak in ka ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka siahhlawh Job khi na hmu maw? Leilung pumpuluk ah amah bangtuk miṭha le rinsantlak zohman an um lo. Keimah i bia ih thil ṭha lo zianghman a tuah lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Satan in, “Zianghman ngah hlah sehla a lo bia duh leem pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah siseh, a innsang siseh, a neihmi hmuahhmuah tiangin na humhim ih na kilkhawi. Thil a tuahmi hmuahhmuah parah mal na sawm ih rannung na pekmi pawl an tamtuk ih an ramah a khat ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A neihmi hmuahhmuah khi laksak ṭheh cila na hmaika rori ah a lo cam mai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Satan hnenah, “Na ti bangtuk cun siseh. A neihmi hmuahhmuah na kut sungah a um. Amah Job lawngte na siatsuah lo pei,” tiah a ti. Cule Satan cu a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Voikhat ah Job ih faate pawl cu an upa bik pa ih inn ah rawl ei khawmnak puai an tuah laifangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mi pakhat cu Job hnenah a ra tlan ih, “Caw thawn lei kan let rero ih laak pawl cu kan kiangkapah hrampi an piat rero laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />rinlopi in Sabean mi pawl in an ra siim ih kan rannung hmuahhmuah in long ṭheh. Keimah siar lo na hnenum hmuahhmuah an that ṭheh. Keimah lawnghi zualkotu ah ka tlan man a si,” tiah Job cu a ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cupa ih ṭong a cem hlanah hnenum dang pakhat a ra thleng ih “ṭeek in na tuurual le na tuukhal pawl a tlak ih an zatein an thi ṭheh. Keimah lawng hi zualkotu ah ka tlan man a si,” tiah Job cu a ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ṭong hman a cem hlanah hnenum dang pakhat a ra tlan lala ih, “Khaldean mi damiah rual bu thum in in siim ih kalauk hmuahhmuah an lak thluh ih tlunah keimah siar lo na hnenum dang hmuahhmuah an that ṭheh. Keimah lawnghi zualkotu ah ka tlan man a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ṭong hman a cem hlanah, hnenum dang pakhat a ra lala ih, “Na fanu le na fapa pawl cu na fapa upa bik inn ih rawl ei puai an tuah laifangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nelrawn ihsin thlisia a ra hrangih an inn a nuaithluk ih a sung um minung hmuahhmuah an thi ṭheh. Keimah lawnghi zualkotu ah ka tlan man a si,” tiah Job cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Job cu a tho ih riahsia in a hnipuan a thlek ṭheh. A sam a meetkolh ṭheh ih leilung ah bok tahrat in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Lawngfangkheh in ka suak ih lawngfangkheh in ka thi ding. Bawipa in i pek ih atu-ah a lak sal. A hmin thangṭhat si ko seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hnenah hibangtuk thil a thleng naón Job cun Pathian a mawhthluk lo ih Pathian hmaiah a sual lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah vanmi pawl an ra khawm ni a thleng sal ih Satan khal cu an hnenah a tel ve lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Khui inso na rat?” tiah a sut. Satan in, “Leilung pumpuluk suk le so ka vahnak in ka ra,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka siahhlawh Job khi na hmu maw? Leitlun ah amah bangtuk miṭha le rinsantlak zohman an um lo. Keimah i bia ih thil ṭha lo zianghman a tuah lo. Zianghman thuhla um loin Job cu, ‘Ka siatsuah ding,’ na ti ih i leem ruangah ka lo lungkimpi; asinain Job cu a hlan vek thotho in rintlak in a nung a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Satan in, “Zovek milai khal sisehla amah ih nunnak hnak cun a neih mi hmuahhmuah a hnong sawn ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A taksa khi vun tuahmawh ngaingai cila hmaiton rori ah a lo cam mai ding,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in, “Na tivek cun si ko seh. Na kut sungah a um a si. Asinain amah cu na that lo pei,” tiah Satan kha a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Satan cu Bawipa ih umnak ihsin a feh ih Job ih taksa pumpuluk ah, a luzim ihsin a kezik tiang, hma sia a suahter ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Job cu a feh ih vutcam lakah to tahrat in a hma cu hlamphei thawn a kheuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nupi in a hnenah, “A hlan vek thotho in rinsantlak in na um lai hrih mawsi? Ziangah so Pathian cu cam tahratin na thih sawn lo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Job in, “Nunau aa vekin na ṭong a si cu! Pathian in thilṭha in pek tikah kan lung a awi. Harsatnak kan hnenih a thlenter tikah ziangah so kan phunzai rero ding?” tiah a ti. Hi bangtuk in a tuar naón Job cun Pathian parah ṭongsia kam khat hman a ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Job ih rualpi pathum cu Teman khua in Elifas, Shuah ram in Bildad le Naamah ram in Zofar an si. Job ih zonzaih retheih tuarnak kha an theih tikah a hnenah va leng in riahsiatpi ding le hneem dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hla nawnih an hei hmuh tikah Job cu an theithiam lo. Job a si ti an theih ngah tikah cun riahsia ninghang in an ṭap an raak ih hnipuan thlek in leivut kha vanah an khirh ih an lu tla ah an theh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule leilung parah ni sarih le zansarih sung an to ih a tuar natsatzia an hmuh ruangah zohman kaa khat hman an ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job cu daitein a um thei nawn lo ih a suah ni kha siat a serh ciamco: Job
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka suah ni cu siatserh siseh; ‘Fapate a suak’ an ti zan khal!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka suah ni cu thimnak ni ah cang seh; Cuih ni cu Pathian in ciing nawn hlah seh; Cuih ni ah tleunak khal tlang hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Riahsiat ni le a pitzet mi thimnak ni ah cang seh; Khawdur in tuam sehla van ih ni khal khi phiat thluh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih zan cu kum siarnak sungah telh loin hnawtfai sisehla, Ziangtik hmanah siar cih si nawn hlah seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zianghman a seem lo zan, zan ṭhahnem lo le, lungawinak um lo zanah tuah siseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih ni camtu dingah polsia pawl sim sehla, Tipi sungih ramsa Leviathan thu a pe theitu polsia pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zing arsi deirel tlang hlah seh; Khawfing a cat ding, tiih beisei nak zianghman um hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih zan cu siatserh siseh, ka suah zan a si ruangah; Zonzaih retheihnak tong lo dingih i hum lo ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nu ih pum sungah rak thi ningla ka va duh so! Asilole ka suah thlak vete in rak thita ningla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziangah so ka nu in a cawn parah i cawi? Ziangah so a pawhte tla i fawh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cunah rak thi ningla atu ahcun ka cawldai zo ding naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuahlan khawpi rop a dinsuah saaltu, Daite ih a itmi siangpahrang le uktu bawi pawl bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An inn sungah sui le ngun khat ko ih a khawltu, Siangpahrang bangtuk in le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />thi ciaih a suakmi naute bangin ka it zo ve ding naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlan sungah cun miṭha lo pawl an siatnak a reh; A baangzet mi hnaṭuantu pawl colhnak an ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thawngtla pawl hman daitein an um thei; Kawk le auhnak in an luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutawkah milian, mifarah an kim; Sal pawl tla an luat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziangah so zonzaih harsatnak a tuarmi an nun ringring? Ziangah so riahsiatu pawl hnenah tleunak a thlen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thih ding lawng an hngak, Asinain thihnak a ra thleng dah lo. Ziangvek thil mankhung hawl hnakin thlaan thlen an duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An thih ih phum an si hlan cu an lung a awi dah lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An hmailam thu cu Pathian in a thuhsak; An kimvel in hauhruang in a kulh ṭheh fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka ṭahnak cu ka ti rawl an si; Ka aihramnak cu reh ti a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ngam lomi le ka ṭih thlohthlo mi hmuahhmuah a zatein ka tuar thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnangamnak ka nei lo, colh ni ka nei lo; Ka zonzaihnak a reh dah fawn lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, kei ṭong ve ningla na hua pei maw? Daite cun ka um thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah in mi tampi na zirh zo, baan thacak lo pawl an baan tha na cakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi an baang ih an sawn an rilh rero tikah, Na ṭong fangkhat cu an dinsalnak a si ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu na hrangih harsatnak tikcu a ra thlen ve tikah, na ning a hang ih na thin a nau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na Pathian biak hi na hnangamnak a si lo maw? Mithiang na si ruangah beiseinak ziangtal na nei lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭhatein ruat hnik! Miding mi siatsuahnak an tong, ti na thei dah maw? Mawh nei lo mi hlohralnak an tong, ti na thei dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tampi in ṭhatlonak cu lo bangin an thlo ih, Siatnak cu thlaici bangin an tuh, ti ka hmu zo. Ṭhatlonak le siatnak cu rawl bangin an khawm ve ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An parah Pathian a thin a hengih thlisia bangin a siatsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl cu kiosa bangin an kio an huuk, Asinain Pathian in a vuakdai hai ih an ha pawl tla a khiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Deh ding le ei ding neilo kiosa bangin an thi, An faate pawl cu an ṭhekdarh aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Voikhat cu ka hnenah a thupte in thu a ra thleng; Dimte in a rat ruangah ka thei thei ceu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />It that thei loih i tuahtu zan mangsia bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thin a phang ih ka thir, Ka pumpuluk in ka khur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlarau in ka hmai thli bangin i hun seem, Ka hmul a tho surso.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih thlarau cu ka hmaiah a ding ka hmu; Ka zoh rero naón ziang a si ti ka hliah thei lo. Cule a dai zirziar mi sung ihsin aw ka thei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Pathian hmaiah miding an um thei ngai pei maw? Siamtu hmaiah minung zotal a thianghlim thei pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian cun a palai pawl hman a zum thei lo; A vancungmi pawl lak hmanah palhnak a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuti a si ahcun tlak ih tuah mi milai hi, Leivut ihsin seemsuah mi, phehlep vekih olte ih rialdip thei mi milai cu a rinsan dingah na zum maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milai cu zinglam ah a nung ko, Asinain zanlam ah zohman ih theih loin a thi ziar thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A neih ciami hmuahhmuah cu lon ṭheh a si; Fimnak tlasam in a thi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Job, hun ko hnik! A lo awitu zotal an um pei maw? Na va pan dingah vancungmi pakhat tal an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thinheng ringring ih nun cu Mi aa pawl thattu a si. Iksiknak cu thinlung mal pawl philtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi aa pawl hnangamzet ih an um ka hmu zo; Asinain rinlopi-ah an innsang cu siatcamnak a tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An faate pawl cu humhimnak an tong thei dah lo; Thuṭhennak hmunah zohman in anmah ṭan ah an ding lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi aa pawl ih lorawl cu rilrawng mi pawl in an ei ding; Hling lakih a khomi rawl tiangin; An lennak cu tihal pawl in an halhsik a si
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhatlonak cu leilung sungin a kho lo; Harsatnak khal leilung sungin a ṭhangmi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meici cu meisa sung ihsin a suak ṭheu bangin, Minung parih a thlengmi harnak cu amah minung lala-ih suahter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei cu nang si ningla, Pathian lam ka hoikir ding, Ka thu cu a hnen ka thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilmak zetzet a tuahmi pawl cu kan thei thei dah lo ding; Mangbangza a tuahmi pawl cu cemni a nei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leiram parah ruah a surter ih loram pawl a ciarter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A si, milungnem a cawisaangtu le riahsia mi hmuahhmuah hnenih lungawinak a petu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi depde pawl ih tumtah mi cu a siatsuah sak ih, Mifim pawl cu an khawkhannak in a awkter a si. Cutin an tuah mi ziangvek hmanah an hlawh a tling lo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun vang hmanah zan khawthim sung bangin an tawivak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in mifarah pawl cu thihnak in a hum ih, Mi tlasam pawl cu namsuknak sungin a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi zonzai pawl hnenah ruahsannak a pek, Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu a vuakdai hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ih nun a simmi cu milungawi an si! Nun a lo sim asile na ninghang duh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in a tuahmawh mi cu amah lala in a tuamhlawm; A kut in hma a baih ih a kut lala in a damter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah in harnak phun ruk sungin a lo hum ding, Pasarih sung khalah ṭhat lonak zianghman in a lo dai thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Paam a thlen khalle a lo thiter lo ding; Raldo a um hmanah thihnak ralnam sungin a lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi-ih relsiatnak sungin Pathian in a lo hum ih, Siatsuahnak a thlen hmanah na him ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thisen luannak le rilrawnnak na hmu ṭheh ding naón, Na hnihsan men ding ih, Sahraang khal na ṭih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na thlawh mi loram ah lungto a um lo ding ih, Sahraang pawl thawn tla rualrem tein na um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na puanthlam sungah thlangam tein na um ding ih, Na tuu pawl na zoh tik khalah an himdam kim kha na hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tefa pawl cu an tamzet ding, Leilung ih hrampi zat an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rawl lak tikcu tiang himte ih a nungmi sangvut bangin, Kum reipi le san ṭha zetin na nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Job, hi thu pawl cu kum reipi kan zir ih kan theih mi a si. Thudik a si, curuangah pom thlang aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tuarnak le riahsiatnak hi Cuaithlainak ah a khing thlai sisehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tifinriat ih vunnel hnakin an rit sawn ding. Ka ṭong hraang in lo mangbangter hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cungnungbik Pathian ih conkiang in ka sungah i kalh; A tur cu ka taksa pumpi ah a zai. Pathian in ṭihnungza thil pawl ka hmaiah a song.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Laak cu hrampi a piat tikah a lung a kim ko; Caw khal daitein hrampi ro a ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain thawtnak neilo, ci phulh lo rawl cu zoso a ei thei ding? Arti hawng in ziang thawtnak so a neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cubangtuk rawl ei ding cu ka hiar hrimhrim lo; Ka ei mi hmuahhmuah cu ka ning seksek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangah so ka dilmi cu Pathian in i pek lo ding? Ziangah so ka thlacamnak cu i leh lo ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in dip seksek in i rial sehla, A kut suah in i cemter sawn sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I that ding ti thei ningla lungawi in ka khir ding, Ziangtluk ih ka tuar hmanah! Pathian cu a thianghlim, ka thei. A thupekmi cu ziangtik hmanah ka el dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nung hrih dingah ziang bangtuk thazaang so ka neih lai? Beiseinak zianghman nei loin ziangah so ka nun duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungto ih tuahmi maw ka si? Ka ruangpi hi dar maw a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hum-aw thei dingin thazaang ka nei nawn lo; Bomnak duh ah pan ding ka nei fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atu vekih zonzaih caan ahcun, Pathian ka dungtun ah siseh, dungtun lo ah siseh, rinsantlak rualpi ka ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih ka rualpi pawl cu, Ruah a sur lo tikih a caar mi tiva bangin i phiartu nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih tiva pawl cu vur le tikhal in an khat naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni a sat tikah an zup ṭheh, a tawne tiangin a kang thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rannung thawn khualtlawng mi lamzin an hlo, Tidai hawl in an vak ih nelrawn ah an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sheba le Tema khua ihsin ṭilva ruun thawn khualtlawng mi pawl tla in an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain a caar mi tiva kapah an ruahsannak a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nannih tla cu ka hrangah cun cuih tiva vek nan si. Ka sizia in hmu tikah nan mang a bang ih in ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Laksawng i ra pe uh ka lo ti maw si? Ka ai ah mi pakhatkhat nawhthuh pek ka lo fial maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Culole ka raal le zaangfah nei lo mihremtu kut in i ra hum uh, ka lo ti maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asile i zirh hnik hmeen uh! Ka sualnak i sim hnik uh! Ṭong loin daitein ka um ding ih ka lo ngaihnik hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ṭong tluangtlam cu lung a lut, Asinain nan ṭong mi pawl cu thulolak lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ṭong mi hi thli meen a si tiah nan ruat! Asile ziangah so ka thinpihnak ṭongkam pawl cu in leh duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngakṭah farah nauta pawl cu camcawhfung zuknak ah nan hmang ih, Nan rualpi ṭha bik nekrawk ih nanmah lian ding nan tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka mithmai i zohhnik uh! Thuphan ka per lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nan luan tuk zo! Mi namnuai nawn hlah uh! I hnong hlah uh! Ka thu cu a dik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain thuphan per rero ah in ruat; A dik le dik lo thleidang thiam lo ah in ruat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Milai nunnak hi hranhram ih ṭuantermi ralkap nunnak bangtuk, Hnaṭuan khung lawng a ṭuantu ih nunnak bangtuk le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thinghnuai daihnem lawnglawng a ngaitu sal ih nunnak vek le, A hlawhman a hngak ringringtu siahhlawh pa bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlakhat hnu thlakhat nun san zianghman ka nei lo; Zankhat hnu zankhat riahsiatnak lawng i pe vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itthat dingih ka zau tikah tikcu a sau cuang; Zanvarte ka lawng ka taal ih khuafing cah ding lawng ka hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka taksa cu tholung in a khat, Ka vun an puar ih an kek sal, Ka hma in hnai an dok thluahthlo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nunnak ni cu ruahsannak um loin an liam vivo; Thiamtaktu ih thiamhrolh hnakin zamrang sawn in an liam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka nunnak cu thaw lawng a si hi thei ringring aw; Ka lungawinak cu a cem zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu-ahcun i hmu, a sinan i hmu sal nawn lo ding. I hawl khalle ka um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mero a kiang ih a hlohta bangin, Milai cu a thi, a kirsal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A inn a pan sal thei nawn lo ih, A theitu khalin an hngilh thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu cu daiteón ka umthei nawn lo! Ka thinheng in ka ṭong suak ding, Ka lung a sia, ka dai nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziangah so i kil ringring? Tipi sungih rulpi ah maw i ruah? Tifinriat rulhrengah maw i ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka zau ih ihkhun ah colh ka tum, Ka tuarmi hi deem deuh thei pang sehla ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain nangmah hrimhrim in mangsia in ka tuk i sumter! Hmuhnak a phunphun i hmuh ih ka thin i phangter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiti vekin harfualfo ih nun cuahco hnak cun, Ka hngawng ih deek tahrat in thih ka duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thin a pit! Nun ka zuam nawn lo. Keimah lawngte in i taan aw, Nun man ka nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milai hi ziangso a si ih hitluk lawmmam in na thupitter? Amah cu ziangruangah so na seherh ringring?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zingtinte na veh ih tu le tu na hniksak ringring hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka cil ka lem caan sungte tal khawdang na hoi lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang, milai thinlung zohhliahtu, Ka sualnak in a lo tuahmawh mawsi? Na hmuibahmi ah ziangah so i tuah? Kei hi na hrang thilrit maw ka si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu i ngaithiam thei dah lo maw? Ka mawhnak cu i ngaidam thei hrimhrim lo maw? Reilote ah thlaansung ah ka it ding; I ra hawl hman cila ka um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thli vek a si mi thulolak na ṭong rero cu na ṭheh zo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in thuding cu a merh dah lo; A dik lo khal a tuah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na faate pawl Pathian parih an sual ruangah, An sualnak vekin cawhkuan a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain atu cun Ziangkimtithei Pathian dil aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thiang ngaingai ih na fel taktak a si ahcun, Pathian in a ra lo bawm ding ih Na innsang a lo tungding sal pei, Laksawng tla a lo pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lennak na sunmi pawl cu zianghman an si lo ding, Pathian ih a lo pek dingmi thawn ṭhim ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuahlan laiih fimnak pawl vun zohsal hnik, Kan pupa pawl ih an theihmi thutak pawl vun ruatsal hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan nunnak hi a tawi tuk ih kan theihmi zianghman a um lo. Leilung parah hin phenthlam bangin kan lan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla khuahlan mifim pawl in lo zirh hai seh, An sim ṭheumi hi ngaihnik aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Papairas cu tidai um lonak ah a kho dah lo; Phaipheng cu a ciarlonak hmunah a um dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An noteet lai ih hman tlak an si hlan hmanah Tidai a kang a si ahcun an vuai hmaisa bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian thei lotu pawl cu cuvek an si. An ruahsannak a cem, Pathian tel loih an nun hnu ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pat phangkhat, maimom innraang phangkhat khi an rinsan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maimom innraang phangkhat an hngauhsan ahcun a din ding maw? Pat phangkhat an vawk ahcun an ding sal thei ngai ding maw?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl cu sun ni tlang ih hrampi bangin an kho, Hmuan ih a hrih a khat ṭheh mi hrampi bangin a kho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hrih in lungto an ngerh ih Lung a ummi pohpoh an zeel ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain vun bawt-awla an cem fai; Cutawkih an um kha zohman in an thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asi, miṭha lo pawl ih lungawinak cu cuvek in a cem; Midang an ra ih an umnak an luah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in mifel cu a hnong lo ding. Miṭha lo pawl ih baan khal a cakter cuang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mithmai ah lungawinak a cuang ding ih, Na kaa cu hnihnak in a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain a lo huatu pawl cu an ning a zakter ding; Miṭha lo pawl ih innsang cu an hloralta ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asiko, cu pawl cu ka theih cia mi hlir an si ko. Sikhalsehla ziangtinso milai in Pathian hmaiah ahcun miding a si thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangtin so Pathian cu thu a el thei ding? Zohman ih leh thei lo dingmi thu thawngkhat khal a sut thei a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ih fimnak cu a thuk tuk, A huham neihmi a kau tuk; Zohman amah dodal in a hmaiah an ding thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlang pawl a ṭhawnter hluahhlo, A thinheng in a siatsuah ṭheh, In ṭhawn a si ti khal an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in ling a hninter ih, Leilung le a hramṭohnak pawl tla an hnin ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian cun a thu in ni khi suak lo dingin a kham thei, Arsi pawl tla zanah vang lo dingin a dawn thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van khi puan bangin a zaar tikah Zohman in an bawm lo. Tipi sung rulhrengih zaang a ke in a palcih theitu Amah lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in vanih arsi - zaangkhua, siruk, likhuk cangthum, ngambawm le zawltling pawl a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thilmak zetzet a tuahmi pawl kan thei thei dah lo ding; Mangbangza a tuahmi pawl khal kan siar cawk dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian cu ka kiang in a lan, Asinain ka hmu thei lo. A feh vivo ko naón ka thei thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A duhduh mi a lak, zohman ih kham theih a si lo. ‘Ziang so na tuah?’ ti ih thusuh ngam khal a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian thinhengnak cu a dai lo, A ral pawl Tipi rulhreng Rahab le a bawmtu pawl cu a palbeek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah ziangtinso Pathian cu ka let thei ding? Ziangtin so amah el theinak ah ṭongfang ka hawl thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mawh nei lo ka si naón anih cu ka let thei lo, ‘I zaangfah hram aw,’ tiah ka thuṭhentu Pathian hnen ih dil lawng hi ka ti theimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ṭongnak ah tikcu i pe hman sehla, Ka ṭongmi i ngai ding ti ka zum thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuhla zianghman um loin, Keimah nuai dingah thlisia a kuat; I tuahmawhnak cu a zai deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaw thawtnak caan hman i pe lo, Ka parih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah in ka ning i hanter sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei thacahnak ka suah ding maw? Pathian tlukih thacak zoso a um? Dingnak thu ah ti sehla, Zoin so zungah a thlenpi thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawh neilo rintlak ka si ko naón Ka awkaa in i mawh thluk, Soisel ding um lo ka si ko naón Ka ṭongmi pohpoh in mawh in phurh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sualnak zianghman ka nei lo, Asinain zianghman a dang nawn lo. Nun hi ka paih nawn lo. Kan sual siseh, kan sual lo khal siseh a dang lo. Pathian in in siatsuah thluh ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rin lopi in mawh nei lomi a thih tikah Pathian in a hnihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian in leilung cu miṭha lo kutah a pek. Thuṭhentu pawl ih mit cu puan in a hup ṭheh. Cu pawl cu Pathian in a tuah lo, nan ti asile zo in so a tuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka tikcu cu ṭhatnak um loin an liam vivo, Zualkotu hnakin a zamrang sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka nunnak ni cu a lan vivo, Papairas ih tuahmi lawng bangin; Ar a namtu khaupi bangin a zamrang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka tuarnak cu hngilh tahrat in, Lungawi sopar ih um ka tum hmanah, Ka zonzaihnak cu keimah duum dingah an ra kirsal cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka harsat tuarnak hi ka ṭih, Pathian in mawh i phurh ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian ih mawh i phurh hnuah cun Ziangah so ka ṭan duh rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka sualnak cu ziangvek satpia, khal in a tlengfai thei lo ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian in fihnungza kuahrum sungah i thlak; Ka hnipuan hman in in zahpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian hi minung va sisehla, ka let thei nasa ding; Kan thu rel dingah zungah kan feh ding ih kan thu relcat a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kan karlak ah palai an um lo; Pathian le kei karlak ah thuṭhen theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian, i hrem nawn hlah; ṭih na nunnak in ka thin i phangter hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutin zianghman ṭihnak um loin ka ṭong ve thlang ding; Ziangahtile ka thinlung cu keimah in ka thei bik a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nun hi ka ning thlang, A siakha zetmi ka phunzainak hi ngaihnik aw! Ninghangzet in ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Pathian, mi mawh na si i ti siang hrih hlah; Ziangvek sual so i puh, i sim hnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zaangfah nei loih i namsuk rero hi a dik na ti mawsi? Na kutzungih na tuahmi nautat hi a dik na ti mawsi? Miṭha lo pawl ih tumtahmi hnihsan men hi a ṭha na ti mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milai ih hmuhdan vekin thil na hmu ve mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan nunnak a tawi vekin na nunnak a tawi ve maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangah so ka sualnak lawnglawng na hawl ih, Ka mawhnak fate bik khal na coih suak ṭheh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mawhnak ka neih lo hi na thei, Asinain zohman in na kut sung ihsin in runsuak thei lo ding tikhal na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kut in i tuah ih i siam; Atu-ah cuih na kut cun i siatsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlak in i siam hi hngilh hlah aw. Leivut cang sal ding in i rialdip ding maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pa kha keimah hrin theinak thazaang na pek ih, ka nu ih pum sungah i ṭhanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ruangpi cu ruh le tha in na tuah ih, Ka ruh cu tit le vun thawn na pehcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nunnak i pek ih duhdawtnak khal i neihter. I kilkhawi ruangah ka nung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na lung sungah a thupte ih in na retmi, Na thin sungah na ret thupmi cu ka thei ngah a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangtikah sual pei maw, tiin i bawh ringring; Ka sualnak a ummi cu malte hman ngaidam na tum hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mawhnak ka neih vete in miharsa le mivanduai ah ka cang. Thil ṭha ka tuah khalle lom ka tong cuang lo. Ka awloksong in ningzak in ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hlawhtlinnak hnihkhat ka neih le kiosa bangin i hawl. Keimah tuahmawh duh ah mangbangza tla na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thu a theitu na nei ringring; Ka parih na thinhengnak cu a luar deuhdeuh; Ka parah na huham cu a thleng ih a thuah a thuah in in nuai ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian, ziangah so ka nu ih pum sung ihsin i suahter? Zohman ih hmuh man hlanah rak thih sawn taak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka nu ih pum sung ihsin thlaan ah rak lanta ningla, A va ṭha deuh ngaingai ding naón, A rak seem dah lo bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi a cem zik thlang a si lo maw? I hnaihnok duh nawn hlah! Tikcu malte ka neihsun cu lungdai in ka hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka feh cing ding, ‘Kir sal nawn lonak ram ah’! Riahsiatnak ram le khuathimnak ramah ka feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thimnak le thihnak phenthlam le buairuainak thawn a khat mi, Tleunak hman a thim thothonak ram ahcun ka feh ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thulolak ṭong hi zotal in kan let lo ding maw? Mi ṭongtam ti men in thiam an co ding mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Job, kan lo let thei lo ah mawsi na ruat? Na puarthau ṭong hin in vuakdai dingah mawsi na zum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ka ṭongmi le ka ruahmi hi a dik, Pathian hmaiah ka thianghlim,’ na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in lo let ve sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fimnak ah hin thuah tampi a umzia, Minung thluak ih theih thei lomi thil tampi a umzia, Na hnenah run phuang hnik sehla, Thungaite ih ti ahcun Pathian cun na tuar ding zat hnakih deem deuh in a lo hrem sokhaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ih natsatzia hi a ramri na thei thei pei maw? Ziangkimtithei ih huham maksakzia hi a suum na tah thei pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A huham cu van hnakin a sang, Nang in ziangso na ti thei? Mithi khua Sheol hnakin a thuk, Nang in ziangso na theih thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian natsatnak cu leilung pumpi hnakin a tum deuh ih, Tipi thuanthum hnakin a kau sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in lo kai tahratin thawng ah lo thlak sehla, Thuṭhennak zungah lo fehpi sehla, zoso a kham thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl zo an si ti cu Pathian in a thei ṭheh; A ṭha lomi an hnaṭuannak tla a hmu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi-aa pawl an fim sal thei pei maw? Hramlak laak kha a ngam cia in a suak dah pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Job, na thinlung diktein ret aw, Na baan pharin Pathian lam hoi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na innih ṭhatlonak le na kutih sualnak pawl cu hlon ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutiin mithmai baal loin um awla, Ral ṭha zet le hngetkhoh zetin nung aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutiin na zonzaihnak cu an reh vivo ding ih, A luanglan mi tilik na theih nawn lo vekin na ciing nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutiin na nunnak cu sun nitleu hnakin a tleu sawn ding ih, A thimzet na timi na nunnak cu zing khawvang bangin a vang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlangam zet le nunnuam zetin na um ding; Pathian in a lo hum dingih colhnak a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na zau huahho ding ih ṭihmi ziang hman na nei lo ding, Mi tampi in bomnak an lo dil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu riahsia in khua an cuan ding ih, Luatnak lamzin an hmu lo ding. A neta bik an thawthawt kha, ruahsannak an neihsun a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asiko, na ṭong mi cu misenpi ruahnak a si. Nan thih tikah nan fimnak cu a cem ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain nanmah tlukin fimnak ka nei ve ko; Nannih hnakin ka nauta cuang lo; Nan ṭong mi cu zokhal ih theih thluh cia mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka rualpi pawl hman in atu ah in hnihsan; Soi ding um lo, a ding mi ka si naón an hni thotho; Sikhalsehla Pathian in ka thlacam mi i leh caan a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nannih cu harsatnak nan tong lo, Curuangah hnihsuahsainak meen ah in hmang; A sawn ciami pa cu nan vuak beet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain rukru le Pathian thei lo pawl cu hnangam zetin an um; An pathian cu an kut ih an ken theimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vate le ramsa hman in tampi an lo zirh thei ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung par ramsa le ti sung nga hnen in fimnak dil uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An zatein Pathian kutih tuahmi an si kha an thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in a ramsa hmuahhmuah a uk ṭheh, Milai ih nunnak cu a kut ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan lei in rawl a thawtzia a theih bangin, Nan hna in mi ṭong theih cu a duh zet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum upa pawl in fimnak an nei, Sansau pawl in theihthiamnak an nei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain Pathian cun fimnak le huham a nei; A hnenah ruahnak ṭha le theih thiamnak a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian ih a balmi cu zoso a sak sal thei ding? Pathian ih thawng a thlakmi cu zoso a suah thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in ruah a kham tikah cun ziang hmuahhmuah an car ṭheh; Tidai a thlah sal tikah cun tilik in ziangtinkim a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian cu a cak ih nehtu a si ringring; Bumtu le bummi pawl khal amah ih ukmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Remruattu pawl ih fimnak cu a siatter ṭheh; Hruaitu pawl cu mi aa bangin hna a ṭuanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang in hreng a khenmi pawl cu a phuaksak hai ih, Thawng ah siangpahrang pawl a thlak hai ih an taai ah taikhap a khap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam le thuneitu pawl cu an ning a zahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rinsan zetmi pawl a vuakdai ih Kum upa pawl ih theihthiamnak cu a long ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuneitu pawl cu mualpho in a ret ih, Uktu pawl an thuneihnak a cemter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawthim sungih thuthup a langter ih, A pit zetmi khawdur kha tleunak ah a thlengter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miphun tampi a tumter ih a cakter; Asinain a neh ih a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An hotu pawl cu a aatter ih, Lamzin thei loin an vakvai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawthim sungah an vak ih Zuri bangin an sawn an ril.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nan ṭongmi hmuahhmuah cu ka mit ih ka hmuh ciami le ka hna ih ka theih cia hlir an si. Ka theithiam lomi a um lo. Nanmah theih zat poh ka thei ko. Nanmah hnak in ka nau cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain nannih thawn thu kan el aw lo; Ziangkimtithei, Pathian thawn kan el aw a si. Ka thu cu Pathian thawn el awk ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan thutheih lozia hi thuphan in nan khuh; Zohman a damter thei lotu sibawi vek nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭong lotein um sawn uhla, Mi in mifim ah an lo ruat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ṭongmi ngai hrih uhla Ka thu feh daan ruat hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangah so thuphan hlir nan rel? Nan thuphan hi Pathian hrangah a ṭhahnem ding nan ti mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian nan ṭan tum ngai mawsi? Thuṭhennak hmunah a hnen ṭangin in el tum maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in lo zingzoi ngai sehla Thil ṭha pakhatte tal na parah a hmu ding maw? Milai nan bum thei vekin Pathian bum thei nan tum maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thupte ih mi thleidannak nan neih a si ahcun, Amah in a lo phuang ding ih nun a lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A huham in a lo phangter ih, A ṭih nunnak na tlunah a tla lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan ṭongṭhimnak pawl cu vutcam vek an si; Nan thu-el thiamnak pawl cu tlak vek lawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Daite in rak um hrih uh, ka ṭong ve ding; A piannaknak ah piang seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ṭihphannak hmun ka thleng, Ka nunnak ka ui nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Beiseinak ka nei nawn lo, Pathian in i that leh ko ding; Sikhalsehla ka thuhla cu a hnenah, a hmai rori ah ka thlenpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ralṭhatnak hin i hum thei meen ding, Ziangahtile miṭha loin Pathian an tong ngam dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka simfiangnak ṭong hi ngai uh, Ka thusimmi hi nan hna ah lut seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thuhla cu ka ngaihtuah kim zo, Thiam in coter ding, ziangahtile ka thu a dik a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ra tahrat in sual i puh ngaingai ding maw? Cutiin asile kei cu daiziar in ka um ding ih ka thi sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil pahnih lo dil duhmi ka nei; Na lungkim awla na hnen ihsin ka relh lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hremnak cu bang thlang awla, Na ṭihnunnak in ka thin i phangter nawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maw Pathian, nang ṭong hmaisa awla ka lo let ding. Culole kei ka ṭong hmaisa ding ih i let aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mawhnak le daan ka buarnak ziangzat so an si? Ka sualnak le ka tlaksamnak pawl i sim hnik?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangruangah so na hmai na thuh? Ziangruangah so ral vekih i zoh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thin phang seh i ti maw si? Kei cu zianghman ka si ual lo, Hnahrawp ka si ko lo maw? Fangkungro pakhat na do rero vek a si ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A mawi lo zetmi sualnak tla i puh ciamco, Ka no lai ih ka rak tuah mi thil sual pawl tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thir cikcin in ka ke na ṭeem; Ka ke kar na zoh hliah ih Ka keneh tiangin na zingzoi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah thingrop bangin ka tlu ih, A muatmi hnipuan bangin ka zaam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nunau sung suak milai hmuahhmuah, An nun a tawi ih zonzaih an tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pangpar bangin an ṭhang ih an ziam sal; Phenthlam bangin an hloralta, Rei an awh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian, na mitsiir hmanin i zoh duh ding maw? Ka thu ṭhen dingah na hmaiah i suahpi ngai ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thiang lomi milai sung ihsin a thiangmi a suak thei ding maw? A suak thei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nun ding kum zat cu khiah cia a si ih, A thla zat tla ruah cia in a um. Na lairel ciami an si ih thleng theih an si nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmundang hoisan awla amah lawng taanta mai aw; A nunnak harsatnak ni cu a nuampi thei tawkin nuampi seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hau ciami thingkung hrang hmanah ruahsannak a um; A cerh ding ih a nung sal ding, A hram note a ṭhang vivo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hram pawl an tar ih, a bul cu leilung ah rop hmansehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tidai a ngah cun a cerh ding ih thing note bangin a kho sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain milai a thih ahcun a cem thla a si. A thih hnu khuiah so a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A car mi tiva bangin le a kang mi tipi bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minung a thih cun a tho nawn lo, Van hmuah a hlohral ṭheh hlanlo an ṭhang sal nawn lo ding; An ihnak ihsin an tho nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mithi khua Sheol ah i thup cila ka va duh so; Na thinheng a reh hlan lo i thup aw. Cule nangmah in a tikcu khiak awla, i theih salnak caan ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Milai a thih cun a nung sal thei ding maw? Asinain tikcu ṭha ka hngak ding, Atu-ih harsatnak caan a liam tiang ka hngak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah i ko dingih kei in ka lo awi ding, Na kutih sersiammi kei in ka parih na lungawinak ka hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ke kar cu na zoh hliah ding, Asinain ka sualnak cu na zingzoi rero lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mawhnak cu i ngaidam ding ih a tompi in na hlon hlo ding; ṭhat lonak ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah na hnawtfai ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlang pawl an cim ṭhehnak tikcu a thleng ding, Lungto tumpi pawl tla phong ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tidai in lungto a ei ṭheh, Lihong in leilung a fehpi ṭheh; Cuvekin milai ih nunsung ruahsannak hmuahhmuah na feh hlo ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milai cu kumkhuadaih in na neh ih an hloral ṭheh; A thih tikah a hmel na thleng ih na dawihlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapa pawl in hminṭhatnak an ngah, Asinain a thei nawn lo; An hmin a siat tik khalah a thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A taksa ruangpi a nat lawng a thei, A thinlung harsatnak lawng a tuar.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, na ṭongmi hi thulolak lawnglawng a si. Nisuah ihsin a rami thli bangtuk lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ṭong vekin mifim zohman an ṭong lo ding; Tican nei lo ṭong cun zohman in anmah ṭannak ah an hmang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ṭihzah lo dingin mi thapetu na si, A hnenih thlacam duh lo dingin na tuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ṭhat lonak in na hmur a zirh; Na hrilmi cu depdetnak lei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ih lo hnon a ṭul lo; Na ṭongkam in sual a lo puh ih a lo hnong zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A suak hmaisa bikmi ah na ruat aw maw si? Pathian in tlang pawl a siam laiah na rak um zo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ih tumtahnak na rak thei cia maw si? Milai fimnak hi nangmah lawngih neih ah maw na ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na theih mi hi kan theih lomi zianghman a um lo. Na theihthiammi kan theihthiam lomi ziangso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan fimnak hi ṭuakpaar cia upa, Na pa hnakih upa sawn hnen ihsin kan zirmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in hlemnak thu a lo ruah, Hmurka neemte ṭong hi na hrangah zianghman a ṭangkai lo maw? Ziangah so na pom duh thotho lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ti hlehle ih na thinheng in in zoh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian parah na ning a hang ih a thang na siat ciamco. Na hmur in ṭongsia a suak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thianghlim milai an um thei ngai ding maw? Pathian hmaiah miding an um ngai pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in a vancungmi hman a zum lo ih, A hmaiah anmah hman an thiang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A borhhlawh mi milai, felnak zianghman nei lo, Tidai in vekih siatnak lawng a intu milai cu, ziangtlukin so a thianghlim lo sinsin ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Job, ka theih ve mi hi ngaihnik! Ka hmuhmi na hnenah ka phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mifim pawl in an pale hnen ihsin An zirmi fimnak thutak in zirh, An thuhmi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An ram sungah ramdang mi zohman an rak um lo ih, Pathian hnenin a hruaisualtu ding milai zohman an um lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miṭha lo le misual in a nunsung hmuahhmuah ah harsatnak a tong. Zaangfah nei lo hrangah hremnak cu retsak cia in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭihphannak aw cu a hna sungah cat loin a thang. Ka him a si, a ti laifangah rukru in an ram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thimnak sungin luat thei dingah ruahsannak a nei lo, Khuitawk hmun in simaw ralnam in a rak hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ruaksa ei dingah langta pawl in an thlir. Ka hmailam cu a thimzet, ti a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A cakzet mi siangpahrang in mi a do bangin, Siatsuahnak in do dingah a bawh ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei a dodaltu le, Pathian hnenih a kuttum a hawi rerotu milai ih nunnak lamzin cu cu bangtuk in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi puarthau le mi luhlul in, Thinlung ruhzet in a ralphaw cu a khai ih Pathian do dingah hmaiah a nor ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khua tampi a nehtu le Innram pawl a luahtu cu amah a si. Asinain raldonak a um tikah cun cuih khua le inn pawl cu a siat ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum rei a lian lo ding, A neihmi pawl rei an awh lo ding, A phenthlam tiang in a hlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thimnak sungin a luat lo ding; A hnge meisa in a kaang ṭhehmi, A par thlisia in a nuai ṭhehmi thingkung bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A aat hraat ih siatnak lawng a rinsan ahcun, A comi cu siatnak lawng a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tikcu a kim hlanah a vuai ding, Thinghnge bangin a ro ding ih a hring sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hmin hlan ih a rah a ṭil ṭhehmi Sabit kuang vek a si ding, A par a ṭilmi Olif kung vek a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian thei lo pawl cun tesinfa an nei lo ding, Nawhthuh tangka in an sak mi inn cu meisa in a kang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Annih cu mi siatsuah a tumtu le ṭhatlonak a tuahtu an si; An thinlung cu mi bumnak lawngin a khat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuvek ṭong cu voi tampi ka thei zo, In hlemnak cu ka hrangah tuar sinsinnak lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Catbaang loin maw nan ṭong rero ko ding? Kan ṭongnet hlan lo tiah maw nan ti ringring ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka umnak ah nannih um in, nan umnak ah kei um ningla, Nan ṭongmi vek hi cu ka ṭong thei ve ko ding. Uang aw zetin ka lu ka thle hngualhngo ding ih, Ka ṭongmi tilik zat sungah, ka lo phim hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruahnak ṭhaṭha in nan thazaang ka cakter ding ih, Ka hmurka in a suakmi ṭongkam cun a lo hneem thei zet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka ṭongmi hin zianghman ṭhathnemnak i pe lo; Daiziar ih ka um khalle ka tuar a deem cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Pathian, i bangter tuk zo, Ka innsang pawl na thihter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah in i hrem, ka ral na si. Ka vun le ka ruh lawng an taang; Cumi ruangah mi in keimah mawh ah in ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thinheng ah Pathian in i bauh i thlek ṭheh; Huatnak thawn a ha i rial hnawh; I mitkem ih cat loin i zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipi in an kaa ang in in hnihsan, Ka kiang an ra ih ka hmai in beng; An ṭangtlang ih in dodal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in miṭha lo pawl ih kut sungah i thlenter, Pathian ṭihzah lotu pawl hnenah i hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Daite ih ka um laiah i siatsuah, Pathian in ka or in i deek ih i sawp ciamco ih i deen. Pathian in a hmuibah mi ah i tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawzakipin conkiang thawn i sai, Conkiang in i ngah ih i hriam; Ka kaileng i ngah, ka hnitkha leilung ah a luang, Cuih hnu hmanah zaangfahnak zianghman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atu le atu hma i baih leuhleuh, Ralkap thinṭeu bangin i nam ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mithi ngai in ka um ih ka vun khuhnak ah buri hnipuan ka hruk; Atu leivut lakah thinpit in ka to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ṭahnak ah ka hmai a sen ṭheh; Ka mit tla an cuur ṭheh ih Ka mit vun a dup ṭiamṭiam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi thisen luannak ah ka kutin zianghman a tuah lo; Pathian hnenih ka thlacamnak cu a tluangtlam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Leilung, ka parih thilsual an tuahmi hi thup hram hlah; Dingnak um seh tiih ka aunak aw hi daiter hram hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu a theitu vanah khin a um, I ṭantu cu a saannak hmunah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I simsaktu cu ka rualpi a si, Pathian amah lawng cat loin ka mitthli thawn ka zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minung in a rualpi a ṭan ciamco ṭheu vekin Mi pakhatkhat in Pathian hmaiah i ṭan sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka kum cu a liam vivo ih, Dungkir nawn lonak lamzin ka zawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka nunnak a cem zik thlang; Ka thaw hman ka thaw thei nawn lo. Thlan in i rak hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I hmuhsuamtu pawl in in kulh ṭheh, Cupawl cu cat loin ka zoh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thuhrennak ah, keimah hi i co hram aw; Kei i ṭantu ding zoso a um cuang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuruah thiamnak neilo dingin an thinlung na phit ṭheh; Curuangah nehtu siter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuahlan ṭongṭhimnak ah, ‘Mi pakhat in tangka duh ah a rualpi a phiar asile, a faate an mit a caw ding’ ti a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih ṭongṭhimnak cu ka parah an thlenter; Ka hnenah mi an ra ih ka hmaiah cil in phui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka riahsia in ka mit khal a mal thluh zik thlang; Ka kut le ka ke pawl cu phenthlam vekin an ṭawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka fel tiih a ruat-awmi pawl an khawruah a har ih, An zatein Pathian thei lo tiah in hnong ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Upat tlak ka si tiih a ruat-awmi pawl in, Kan dik a si, tiah an zum sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an zatein ka hmaiah ra ding hnik hai sehla, An lakah mifim pakhatte hman ka hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nunnak ni cu a liam vivo; Ka tumtah mi pawl an hlo deuhdeuh; Ka saduhthah pawl an cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain ka rualpi pawl cun zan khi sun an ti; Khua a vang zik thlang an ti, Asinain kei cu khawthim sung thotho ah ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ruahsanmi cu mithi khua Sheol lawng a si; Cutawkah khuathim sungah ka ihphah ka phah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawhrum cu ‘Ka pa,’ ka ti dingih, I eitu tholung pawl cu, ‘Ka nu’ culole ‘ka farnu,’ ka ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuti asile ka beiseinak cu khuiah so a um? Ka ruahsanmi i hmuhsaktu zotal an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mithi khua Sheol ka feh tikah Ruahsannak in i thlun thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, nangmah vek milai hi, Daite in na um thei lo maw si? Kan thu ngai dingin cawl hrih awla Kan lo sim ve hnik pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rannung vek ih aa ah in ruat, Ziangtin so ramsa tlukih in ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thin a heng ruangah na tuar deuhdeuh a si; Nangmah ih ruangah leilung hi a ṭhing ding maw si? Nangmah ih ruangah tlang pawl hi an ṭhawn ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih mei-inn cu an mit ding; An meisa cu ziangtik hmanah a alh sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puanthlam sung ih tleunak cu khawthim ah canter a si ding. An kiangih mei-inn an mit ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ke kar a rak hngetzet, Asinain atu cu a ke a awl; Amah ih ruahnak ruangah a ril riai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sur sungah a feh ih a ke in a awk, Kuahrum sungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thang in a kedil a awk, Cutiin luat loin a taarhaak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leilung parah palphum an siah ih, A lamzin ah thang an kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kimvel in tuksumza in a bawh, Khuitawk lam a feh hmanah a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Milian a si ṭheu naón atu cu rilrawng in a tha a cem. A kiangin siatnak in a bawh, A rilhbah ding lawng a hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pumpuluk in natsia in a tlun, A kut le a ke pawl an ṭawt ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlangam zetih a umnak puanthlam sungih sin an dirsuak, Thihnak Siangpahrang tong dingah an caih hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Atu-ah zokhal a puanthlam sungah a um thei; Natsia um nawn hlahseh tiah Kaat meialh thawn an ur hnuah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hnuailam ah a hrih a thi ih, a tlunlam ah a ṭeek pawl an vuai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hmin cu an khua le an ramah, ramdang khalah a cem riai; Lamzin ah zohmanin an cing nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minung umnak leilung ihsin dawihlo a si ding; Tleunak ihsin thimnak sungah dawihlo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cithlah tesinfa zohman a nei lo, A nehhnu ih a nungtu an um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nisuahnak ihsin nitlaknak tiang mipi in cuih thu an theih tikah, an thinphang in an khur thlohthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl ih tonmi le dinhmun cu cubangtuk a si; Pathian zianghman ih a siar lotu pawl cu!
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangtik tiang lawmmam so nan ṭong in in hrem rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A voi siarcawk lo in hmuhsuam, Hitiih in hmuhsuam ruangah ningzah nan thiam fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sualnak ka tuah ngai hman sisehla, Nannih natnak ziangso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimah hnakih miṭha deuh ah nan ruat aw; Ka tuarnak ruangah ‘A mawh’ tiah in ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawhnak ih i retu cu Pathian a si hi nan thei thei lo maw? Keimah awk duh ah thang a kam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Thisen a luanter,’ tiih ka au khalle zohman in an ngai lo; ‘I bawm uh’ ka ti khalle dingnak a um cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in ka lamzin a phit ih ka feh thei nawn lo; Ka lamzin cu khawthim in a khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka sunlawinak hmuahhmuah i long ṭheh zo; Ka hminthannak hmuahhmuah a cemter ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kaa kipin i vuak ih i cemter, Ka ruahsannak cu zanthing bangin a hram in a phong, Vuai ding le thi dingah i taanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka parah a thinhengnak cu meisa bangin a alh; A ral ṭihnung bikah i ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keimah do dingah a ralkap pawl a thlah; Phardawl lan thei dingah a lengin leilung an dawl ih an khahsilh; Ka deuthlam an kulh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in a forh ih ka unau pawl in in tlansan ṭheh; I thei ciatu pawl khal mikhual ah an cang ṭheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sungkhat pawl in in tlansan, Ka rualpi pawl in in taanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka inn ih a riak ṭheumi pawl in in hngilh ṭheh zo; Ka siahhlawh nunau pawl in mikhual le ramdangmi ah in ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hnen-um ka ko ih i awi lo, Bomnak dil ih ka leem hmanah in pan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nupi in ka thaw namsia a tuar thei lo; Ka suahpi ka unau hman in in fih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nauhak pawl in in hmuh tikah in hmuhsuam ih in hnihsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka rualpi ṭha bik pawl hman in in ningsin, Ka duhdawt bikmi pawl ka ralah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ruh parah ka vun a thlai aw niarniar; A nung ti theih fangfang ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nannih cu ka rualpi nan si! I zaangfah hram uh! Pathian kut in i vuak thluk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian ih i hrem vekin ziangah so nannih tla cun in hrem? Hi tluk in tuarter hi tawk nan ti lo maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hitiih ka ṭong mi hi zotal in rak khum hai sehla, Cazual sungah rak ngan hai sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Culole thirkhen thawn lungpheng parah ṭelh in, Kumkhua hmun dingin ngan hai sehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asinain keimah i ṭantu cu a nung ti ka thei; A netnak ah leilung parah a ding leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Natnak in ka vun cu ei ṭheh hmansehla, Hitiih ka tisa thawn Pathian cu ka hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka mit rori in amah ka hmu ding, Midang si loin keimah rori in ka hmu ding a si. Cumi cu ka thinlung in a hngakhlap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Ziangtin so kan hrem thei ding?’ nan ti ruangah ka tha hmuah a poih ṭheh zo. Keimah hrem duh ah thudang nan hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu cun ralnam ṭih thlang uh! Sualnak parih Pathian thinhengnak a thlengtertu ralnam cu! Cutiin thuṭhentu a um sokhaw ti nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, ka riah i siatter; Na thu let loin ka um thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ṭong cia mi pawl hi hmuhsuam nak ṭong an si; Asinain ziangvek in ka lo sawn ding, ti ka thei, theihthiamnak ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na theih vekin, hlanlaipi leilung parih minung an um hramthok ihsin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miṭha lo lungawinak cu tikcu tawite lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhangso in van tiang hmansehla, A lu in vanrang dai hmansehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leivut vek thli in a semhlo ding; A rak thei ciatu pawl in ‘Khuiah so a si’ an ti rero ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zanmang bangin a hlo ding; Mang ih hmuh mi bangin ziangtik hmanah hmuh sal a um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmutu mit in an hmu lo ding; A um ṭheunak hmun in a hlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Farah zonzai hnen ihsin a ruk mi thilri pawl cu, A fapa pawl in an lennak sungin an pek kir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nonal ih a cakvakmi a ruang cu, Rei lote-ah leivut ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo cu a thlum zetin a thei; Curuangah a hrekkhat a ka sungah a hmawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lei hnuai ah reipi a ret, A thlummi kha a phui siang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain cuih rawl a eimi cu a pumpi sungah a kha; Thihsii vekin a kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in a rukmi thilri cu a luak sal ṭheh; Pathian in a long sal, a pumpi sung ta hman a phorh sal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo ih a dolh mi cu thihsii a si; Rul hraang ih tur bangin mi a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tiva bangin olif siti a luangmi cu a hmu lo ding; Cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luangmi khal a hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hna a ṭuan sanmi hmuahhmuah ei loin a hlon a ṭul ding; A lennak thilri pawl nuam in a hmang man lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ziangahtile farah pawl a namsuk ih zianghman ah a siar hai lo. Mi inn sak cia pawl tla a long.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A duhhamnak cu cem ti a nei lo; Curuangah a sunloih mi thilri hman hum theimi zianghman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A in a ei ih a hlah mi zianghman a um lo; A lennak cu a rei hlanah a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlawhtling zetin a um laifangah, Vansan malmaknak a ra thleng; Harsatnak le riahsiatnak nasa zetin a hnenah a thleng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A duhzat in ei ko seh! Pathian thinhengnak cu a hnenah meisa bangin a alh ding ih ruah bangin a parah a sur ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlan a tum ih thir ralnam in a luat hmanah, Dar conkiang in a ngah ih a thin a sun ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Conkiang cu a pum ah a phun aw, Cuih conkiang cu an suah ngah; A tleumi a zik hriam ihsin thisen for khat hnu for khat a tla; Cutikah a thinlung cu tuksumnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khawl ciami thilri hmuahhmuah cu siatsuah an si; Milai ih muah lomi meisa in amah le a innsang an kaang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi pa sualnak cu van in a langter; Amah do dingah leilung cu a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian thinhengnak cu tilik bangin a ra ding ih, A lennak hmuahhmuah a zatein a siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih tonmi cu cu bangtuk a si; An hrangah Pathian ih lairel ciami a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ṭongmi hi ngaihnik uh! In hnem theinak cu cumi lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭong theinak tikcu i pe uh, Ka ṭheh tikah nan duh asile i hnihsan leh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring thawn thu kan el-aw a si lo! Ka thin a tawi khalle ka mawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I zohhnik uh! Mangbang tuksum le ṭong loin nan kaa nan hup a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka parih thil cangmi ka ruah ah, Ka khawruah har tukah ka khur rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangah so Pathian in miṭha lo pawl hi an nunnak a zuah? An san a sauter ih milian sinsin ah a tuah hai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An tu le an fa pawl pitlin tiang hmuta man ih an nun?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in an innsang ah harsat vansaannak a thlengter lo ih, Thinphan thlaṭemnak tla an tong dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asi, an caw pawl tla an him ih vansiatnak tong lotein an pungzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An faate pawl cu suk le so ah an tlan ih, tuu faate bangin an lek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭingṭang le khuangte tum in an laam detdo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnangam zetin tarkuun an nung ih harsatnak tuar lo daiteón an thita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in “In tlansan aw,” tiah Pathian an ti; “Na lamzin hi a theih khal kan duh lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei kan biak rero a ṭul lo, A hnenih thlacam rero khal a ṭhahnem lo, tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Kan cahnak in kan hlawhtling pam,’ an ti. Asinain an ruahdan cu ka pom thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo ih meifar cu a mit dah maw? Anmah lakah zotal in harsatnak an tong dah maw? Pathian in a thinheng in mi ṭha lo pawl a hrem dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hrampi ro vekin thli ih sem dingah le Leidip vekin thlisia ih nuai hlo dingah a tuah hai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pa sualnak ruangah a fa parah Pathian cawhkuan a thleng, nan ti. A si lo, misual parah Pathian hremnak thleng seh. Nan sual ruangah ka lo hrem a si, ti tla fiangtein langter seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Misual pawl in an sualman siatsuahnak tuar hai seh; Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih thinhengnak tong hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi pakhat a nunnak ni a cem tikah a taantami a innsang le faate ih thu a hun thei nawn ding maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zotal in Pathian a zirh thei ding maw? Van ih a ummi pawl par hmanah thu a ṭhentu Cungnungbik parah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihrek cu an thih ni tiang mi harhdam an si; Lungawi le thinnuam in an um ih an taksa ṭhazet cing in an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihrek cu lungawinak an nei dah hrimhrim lo; Thinhar in an nung ih thinhar in an thi cihta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cute pahnih cu an thi ih phum an si; An pahnih in tholung in an khat ṭheh veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ziangvek ruahnak nan nei, ti ka thei. Keimah siatsuah dingah ruahnak ṭha lo nan nei ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nannih in, “Milian pa ih inn cu khuiah so a si? Thilsual a tuahtu pa cu khuiah so a um?” tiah nan sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khualtlawng pawl thawn nan bia aw dah lo maw? Annih ih an ra simmi thu nan thei dah lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian a thin a heng ih mi a hrem tikah, A luattu cu mi ṭha lo an si ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pa sual puhtu ding zotal an um maw? A tuahmi hmuahhmuah a thungrultu zotal an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A thih tikah ṭhateih kilmi thlaanmual ah an zawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A thlaan ih leilung an silh mi hman a hrangah a neem; Mi thawng tampi in an thlah, A hmaiih siar cawk lo a rak feh ciami pawl vek khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nannih pawl cun thulolak in a hnem in tum; Nan ṭongmi hmuahhmuah hi thuphan hlir a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangvek milai, mifim bik khal sisehla, Pathian hrang ih mi ṭhahnem an um ngai ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thildik na tuahmi cu Pathian hrangah a sawtnak a um maw? Asilole na ṭhatnak in Pathian ziangtal a bawm maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nun a lo zirh ih hniksak na ton hi Pathian na ṭihzah ruangah a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ṭhatlonak a nasat ruangah le Na sualnak a tamtuk ruangah a si sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na unau in tangka an lo baakmi kuanter dingah thuhrennak na lak; A hnipuan cu na long ṭheh ih hruk ding dang zianghman nei loin na ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thabaang ih tihal mi pawl hnenah tidai na pe lo ih, Rilrawng mi pawl hnenah rawl na pe duh fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huham na neihnak le mi upa na sinak cu, Ram pumpi luah thluhnak ding lawngah na hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuhmei pawl na bawm duh lo lawng si loin Ngakṭah farah pawl an thil na long ih na siatsuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah na kiangkapah a lo awktu ding thang tampi an um; Rinlopi in ṭihphannak in na khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thimnak a sah tuk ih zianghman na hmu thei lo; Tilik in a lo khuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vancung saangbikah Pathian a um; Arsi pawl cu an saang ve naón, Pathian in a run zohsuk hai a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain nang in, “Pathian cun ziangso a theih ding? Mero in a phen a sisi! Ziangtin so ka thu a ṭhen thei ding?” tiah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vankuumpi parah Pathian lam a len tikah, Mero sahzet in a phen ih i hmu lo ding, tiah na ruat!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih an thlun ringring mi lamzin hlun cu, Thlun dingah na duh thotho maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an tikcu a kim hlanah tilik in a fen hai; Hrihram an neihmi hmuahhmuah thawn a fenhlo thluh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himi pawl cu Pathian a eltu le Kan parah zianghman a tuah thei lo ding, tiih a ruattu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain anmah a liantertu cu Pathian Amah thotho a si; Mi ṭha lo pawl ih ruahnak cu ka ngaih lo zawng hrimhrim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl hremnak an tuar tikah cun, Mi ṭha pawl an lung a awi ih mawh nei lo pawl an hni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih thil neihmi hmuahhmuah cu a cem, A taangsun cu meisa in a kaang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah Job, Pathian thawn rem aw uh, Amah cu na ral ah ruat nawn hlah, Cutin asile a lo thlawsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thuzirh mi cu pom awla, A ṭong cu na lung sungah ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A si, tangdornak thinlung thawn Ziangkimtithei hnenah kir awla, Na inn sungih thil ṭha lo hmuah cu a hlapi ah hlon aw; Cutin a lo hlawhtlingter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na sui hlawnthil hlon ṭheh aw; Ofir ihsin na sui ṭha bik khal tikua lungto bangin hlon ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian cu na sui a si ding ih, Amah cu hril hleice mi ngun bangtuk na hrangah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutiin Pathian cu na lungawinak a si ringring ding ih, Mithmai ṭha thawn Amah lam thinnuam in na hoi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thla na cam tikah a lo let ding; Na tiamkammi pawl cu feltein na kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na thu relcatmi hmuahhmuah tuahsuak an si ding ih, Na fehnak lamzin a tleu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in mi puarthau pawl a ṭhum ih, Mi tangih a dor pawl a hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tuah mi a thiang ih mawhnak neilo na si ahcun Amah in a lo run ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian parih ka phunzainak cu a besia deuhdeuh, Ka hrumraknak khal a zual sinsin, Ka parih a kut a rih tuk ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A fehnak lamzin thei ningla, A umnak hmun khal thei ningla, ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnenah ka thu ka thlenter ding; Ka thu cu famkim zetin ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hnenih a ṭong dingmi le I son dingzia tla theih ka duhzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A huham neih zat in Pathian in i do pei maw? Do hlah e, ka ṭong mi ṭhatein a ngai sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka fel a si, Pathian thawn thu kan rel tlang ding; Mawhnak na nei lo, tiah kumkhua daih in i ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nisuahnak lamah ka hawl zo, Cunah Pathian a um lo. Nitlaknak lamih ka hawl khalle a um thotho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian cu saklam le thlanglam ah hna a ṭuan; Asinain ka hmu thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in ka kekar kar khat tiangin a hmu, I hniksak asile sui vekih ka thian kha a thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hrangih a hrilmi lamzin cu feltein ka thlun; Vorhlam ah siseh, kehlam ah siseh, ka pial hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmurka ihsin a suakmi thupekmi cu pialsan loin ka tuah ringring; Ka duhmi si loin amah ih duhmi ka thlun ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian cu a thleng aw dah lo; Zohman in an dodal thei lo ding ih, A tuah duhmi cu zohman in an kham thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hrangih tumtahnak a neih mi pawl a kimter ding, Cuih tumtahnak tlunah tumtahnak dang tampi a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hmaiah ṭihphang in ka khur, Cumi ka ruah tikah cun ka ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian in ralṭhatnak ka neih mi hmuahhmuah a hlohralter ṭheh; Thimnak in ka mit cawtter hmansehla, I ṭihtertu ngaingai cu thimnak a si lo, Pathian Amah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangah so Pathian in thuṭhennak ni a khiah lo? Amah a riantu pawl in thudik an conak dingah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milai in ram tam deuh ngah duh ah ramri lungphun an ṭhawn; Tuu an rak fir ih anmah ih tuu lakah an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngakṭah farah pawl ih laak tla an fir; A leiba a kuan ṭheh hlan lo nuhmei nu ih cawcang an hren.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zonzai pawl an palcih hai ih, Mi tlasam pawl cu anmah ṭih ah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah mifarah pawl cu hramlak laak bangin ramcaar ah rawl an hawl; Khuitawk hmanah an faate hrangah rawl an ngah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midang lo sungah rawl an lak; Mi ṭha lo pawl ih sabit hmuanah sabit rah an khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zan ah puan loin lawngte in an it, An taksa hlumtu zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlang par ih ruah in a ciah hai; Beunak a um lo ruangah lungpi phenah an bek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in pa nei lo nauta pawl salah an zuat; Mifarah ih faate pawl cu leiba ai ah an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi zonzai pawl hnipuan nei loin khawleng ah an feh; Fangteel an phur rero naón an ril a rawng thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siti dingah olif an rial, Sabitti dingah sabit rah an rial; Asinain an ti a haal thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawpi sungah hriamhma pu mi le A thi cuahco mi pawl an au rero; Asinain an thlacamnak cu Pathian in Zianghman ah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Annih cu tleunak duh lotu an si; A theih khal an thei lo ih a lamzin an thlun duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zinglam khawfingcatah mithattu cu farah le mitlasam that dingah a pok, Cule zanah mi thil a fir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uire pa cu khawthimah mi a hngak, ‘Zohman in in hmu lo ding’ a ti; Theih ṭih ah a hmai a khuh-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fifir in zan ah inn an bauh, Asinain sun ahcun inn ah an relh; Tleunak cu an hrial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sun vang cu an ṭih; Asinain zan khawthim cu an ngam. [Zofar]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cu tilian in a fenhlo; A ram neihmi cu Pathian ih siatcam mi ram a si; A sabit hmuan ih hnaṭuan dingah an feh nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vur cu a satnak le a caarnak hmun ahcun a ziam vekin, Misual cu a nungmi umnak ram in an hlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zohman in an thei lo, amah ih nu hman in a ciing nawn lo; Tholung in an ei ih zanthing tlu bangin a rop ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziangahtile nuhmei a tisiat, Fa nei lo a cingmi nunau parah, Zaangfahnak zianghman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in a huham in micak pawl a siatsuah, A caangvai ih miṭha lo an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in himnak hmunah a umter, Asinain a mit in a thlingthla ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Caan tawi sung cu mi hlawhtling zet a si; Asinain rei lote-ah hrampi bangin a vuai sal; Ah ciami fangkung bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka simmi vekin a si lo, tiah a el theitu nan um maw? Ka ṭongmi hi a dik lo, tiah a langter theitu nan um maw?
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hnenah cahnak le huham a um, Amah cu maktara a si; Curuangah zokhal in nan ṭih pei, A ukmi vancung ramah daihnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zotal in amah riantu vancungmi an siar thei pei maw? Pathian tleunak a thlen lonak hmun khui talah a um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian mithmuh ah, nunau hrinmi milai lakah miding an um pei maw? Zotal a thiangmi an um pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mithmuh ah thlapi khal a vaang lo ih arsi khal an fai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuti a si ahcun milai cu cucik kharbok le tholung tluk fang a si; Pathian mithmuh ziangtluk inso a fai lo sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hrangah ziangtluk bawmtu ṭha so na si! Mifarah, miṭawnṭai kei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ruahnak ṭhazet mi na pe thei, Kei vek mi aa na fimnak na hlawm duh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizat na ṭong hi zo in so ngai cawkseh na ti? Hi vek ṭong dingah zoso a lo fial? [Bildad]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithi pawl ih thlarau cu an khur, Leilung thuai ih tidai sungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mithi khua Sheol cu Pathian hmai ah a lang ṭheh; Hlohralnak hmun cu phentu ziang hman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in saklam van cu a pharh; Van thlahawmpi sungah leilung cu a thlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mero sungah tidai a ret; Tidai a rit zet naón a pah lo, Pathian in a kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlapi cu mero phen ah a thup; A hmai hmuahhmuah a khuhter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tipithuanthum parah rikhaam a riin ih Cutiin tleunak cu thimnak in a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van hun dotu ṭhuam pawl an hnin, A hro hai tikah an thin a phang ih ṭihnak thawn an khur ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thazaang cakin tifinriat a neh; A thiamnak in rulhreng Rahab a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thaw thawt in van a faiter ih, A kut in rulpi a tlanmi cu a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain hi pawl cu a cahnak zimte lawng an si; Kan theih mi hi cu a thlizil fang a si; Pathian a maksakzia taktak cu zoso a thei thei ding?
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian, ding thluk lairelnak i coter lotu le, Ninghang in i tuahtu a nungmi Pathian hmin saal in thu ka kam:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in nunnak thaw i pekmi ka neih sungah cun, Pathian ih i pekmi ka hnar ih ka thawt sungah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmur in ṭongsia a suak lo ding ih, Ka lei in thuphan a per lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nannih nan dik tiah ka ti dah lo ding; Mawhnak ka nei lo tiah ka thih ni tiangin ka ṭang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thudik ih ka dinnak cu ka thlah thei dah lo ding; Ka lung a thiang; ka thinlung in ‘Ka mawh ngai’ a ti dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah i raltu le i dotu pawl cu Mi ṭha lo le miding lo vekin hrem si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian a thei lotu pawl in ziang ruahsannak so an neih ding, Pathian in an nunnak a cemter tikcu caan ahcun?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Harsatnak an ton ih an au tikah, Pathian in an aunak a thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian ah an lung a awi pei maw? A hnenah thla an cam ringring ngai pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian huham a makzia cu ka lo sim hai ding; Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih tumtah mi cu ka lo theihter hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nanmah rori in nan hmu fingfing zo; Curuangah ziangah so hivek thulolak nan ṭong rero? [Zofar]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian in mi ṭha lo, thisen suah ṭih lo pawl A hrem haizia cu hivek in a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fapa tampi an neih hmanah ralah an thi ṭheh ding; An faate pawl in rawl khopkham ei ding an nei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nungsun hnihkhat cu natnak in an thi thotho ding, An nupi pawl hman in an ṭah hai lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in ngun siar cawk lo an nei ding; Hnipuan tla vuun liailiai in, an ṭulmi hnakih tam an nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla miṭha hrekkhat in cuih hnipuan cu an hruk ding, Mifel hrekkhat in an ngun cu an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih sakmi inn cu a hnget lo; Maimom innraang vek le, lo kiltu sal pawl ih sakmi deute vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Caan khat sung cu lian zetin an it ding ih, An hung ṭhang tikah an lennak cu A rak cem ṭheh ti an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rinlo tilik vekin tuksumnak in a tlak ding; Zan thli hrang in a semhlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nisuahnak lam thlisia in an inn ihsin a semhlo hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Luat an tum rero lai hmanah, Zaangfah nei loin a nuai hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An tlan phah ah thlisia cun a hran vivo ih, ṭihnung zetin a nuai hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngun an laihnak khur a um; Sui an thianternak hmun a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milai in thir cu leilung sungin an lai, Dar cu lungto sungin an titter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Milai cu a thuk bik thimnak hmun tiang an thleng; Leilung sung a thuknak ah an lut, Thimnak sungah lungto an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milai umnak ihsin a hlatzet ah Milai ke ih pal dah lonak hmunah lungmankhung an lai leikua sungah; Cutawkah anmah lawng hna an ṭuan, Khur sungah hri in an thlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung parah thlairawl a kho; Asinain cuih leilung sung cu Meisa kaang vekin an ling an so ih an let aw hluahhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leilung ih lungto sungah mepian lungmankhung a um; A leivut lakah sui an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih khur sung fehnak lamzin cu khaupi in a thei lo; Langta hman a tlunah a zam dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kiosa siseh, sahrang dang siseh, Cuih lamzin cu an zawh dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milai in a hak bikmi lungto an lai; Tlang hman a hram in an lailet ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungto lakih kua an laih tikah Lungto mankhung an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tiva hna tla an hmusuak ih Leilung sungih thuh mi thil an phorh suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain fimnak cu khuiah so ton a theih ding? Theihthiamnak cu khuiah so zir a thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fimnak taktak cu minung umnak hi leilung ahhin a um lo; A man ngaingai cu zohman in an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thuukmi tifinriat le a thuukmi tipithuanthum in, ‘Hinah fimnak a um lo,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fimnak cu sui in lei a theih lo; Ngun khal in lei a theih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sui ṭha bik le lungmankhung pawl khal in a man an tluk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A man cu sui hnakin a tam sawn; Sui kheng le thlalang ṭha bik man hnakin a tam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fimnak man ngaingai cu lungvar mankhung, lungsen mankhung le Lung sendup mankhung man hnakin a tam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ṭha bikmi lung-aihre mankhung le sui ṭha bik thawn khal fimnak cu ṭhim theih ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuiah so fimnak hram cu a si? Khuiah so theihthiamnak cu a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leitlun ih a nungmi minung le ramsa in an hmu dah lo; Van ih a zammi vate khal in an hmu dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thihnak le siatsuahnak hman in, “A thluathlam ih relmi lawng kan thei,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian lawngin lamzin a thei; Amah lawngin fimnak lamzin le a hmun cu a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangahtile amah in leilung deng tiang a hmu ih, Vanrang hnuai thil hmuahhmuah khal a hmu ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian in thli cu hmual a neihter ih, Tifinriat hrangih ramri a rak tuah tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ruah a surnak ding hmun a ruat cia ih, Khawri le ṭeektla hrang lamzin a rak sial tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Culai ah Pathian in fimnak cu a hmu ih man a neihzia a hniksak. Cule a lungkim in a hngetter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian in milai hnenah, “Fimnak neih nan duh asile Pathian ṭihzah uh; Theihthiamnak neih nan duh asile a ṭha lomi hrial uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job cu hiti in a ṭong sal:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunnak hi a hram in thok thei sal sehla, Pathian in i rak zoh camcin lai vek khan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ih mei-inn cu ka lu parah a tleu ih, Khawthim sung ka feh tikah tleunak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Culai ahcun ka rak neinung zet ih Pathian ih pawlkomnak ruangah ka innsang cu a him.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian ka hnenah a rak um ih, Ka faate pawl khal ka kiangkap ah kimtein an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka caw le ka me pawl in hnawi tampi in pek; Lungkhol lak khalah ka olif kung an kho thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawsung upa pawl an ton awknak khawpi kotka ih ka to ve tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In hmuh vete in mino pawl cu an kiang, Upa pawl tla in upatnak langter in an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hotu pawl an ṭong nawn lo, An hmurka huh mi an bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An lakih mi upa pawl tla an dai khepkhep. An lei a caang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I hmutu le ka thu i theitu pawl hmuahhmuah in, Ka hnaṭuanmi ruangah in porh zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mifarah an au tikah ka bawm, Ngakṭah zonzai zohman bawmtu nei lo ka zoh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Awloksong vansaanglam mi pawl in in thangṭhat zet, Nuhmei pawl tla himnak le thinlung nomnak ka hawl sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dingfelnak cu hnipuan bangin ka hruk ih, Dingthluk lairelnak cu puanfual le lupawng bangin ka hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitcaw pawl hrangah an mit can-ai ka si; Ke-awl pawl hrang khalah an ke can-ai ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Farah zonzai hrangah pa ka si ih Ka theih lo mikhual pawl harsatnak an ton tikah ka ṭan hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zaangfahnak nei lo thuneitu pawl ka siatsuah ih, An hremmi pawl ka luatter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum reipi nung dingah le Ka inn sungah thlangamte ih thi dingah ka ruat aw ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hrihram in tidai a ngahtu le A hnge in daitla a dong ringringtu thingkung vek ka rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zokhal in in lawm, i relsiatu zohman an um lo; Ka thazaang a ṭum suk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midang hnen ruahnak ka pek tikah Daite in ka thu cu an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka sim ṭheh tikah kam khat hman, El ding le beet ding an nei lo. Ka ṭongmi cu an sungah ruahti bangin a pil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zokhal in ka ṭong ngai ding an hiar zet, Lothlo pawl in ṭoruah an duh zet bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thin a nau tikah ka mithmai ṭha ka langter; Hni suamso ih ka um tikah an thin a nuam sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hotu hna ka ṭuan ih thurel ṭulmi ka relcat; Siangpahrang in a ralkap pawl a ho vekin ka ho; An riah a siat asile ka hnem hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asinain atu-ah cun ka hnak ih mino deuh tla in, Hnihsuahsainak meen ah in hmang; An pa le pawl cu zianghman ih ṭhahnem lo, Ka tuu kiltu ka uico bawmtu hmanah ka duh lomi pawl an rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tha nei lo micor pawl, ka hrangah zianghman ṭuan thei ding lo pawl kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An farah, an ril a rawng tuk ih Zan khawthim ramṭhing tla ahcun Thinghram ro hman a nget rero ding pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nelrawn hrambur an bawt ih an ei, Thawtnak zianghman nei lomi hmunphiah kung tla an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in an hauh ih an dawihlo; Fifir nan hauh vek khin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungpuk le khaam ih an laih mi kua sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hramlak ah ramsa bangin an ai, Hrambur thuai ah an ben aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭhahnem lo, zianghman ih siartlak lo rual, Ram sung ihsin dawihlomi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu ahcun an ra ih in ra hnihsan, Kei cu an puahcokmi lawng ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ti daan cu luaksuakza a si; Ka hrangah cun mi ṭha tukah an ruat aw, Ra tahrat in ka hmaiah cil in ra phui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in mi ṭawnṭai le bawmtu nei lo ih i tuah ruangah, An thinhengnak cu ka parah an burh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miburpi in suupnak neiloin in do, In dawi ih tlanhloter in tum; Neta bik siatsuah ding an timtuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka luatnak lamzin in in khan ih a siatsuah in tum; A rak khamtu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ṭankhuarnak hruang pawl an pahtlang ih, Ka parah an rung tla ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭihphannak in i neh, Ka hminthannak le huham ka neihmi cu thli vekin an hlo ṭheh. Ka lennak cu mero vekin a hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atu cu thih ding lawng ka baak; Ka tuarnak a deem deuh ti a um dah cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zan ah ka ruh hmuahhmuah in a na; I ṭam rerotu cu reh ti a um dah cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in ka angki hngawng in i kai ih, Ka hnipuan peeng ṭheh in i dirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ciarbeek sungah i hlon ih Hnawmhne le vutcam tluk ka si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian, ka lo ko naón i sawn dah lo; Thla ka cam khalle i umsan meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zaangfah nei loin i tisiat a si. Na tha neih tawp in i hrem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thli i sem hloter; Thlisia lakah nangmah in i hlon ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Milai zokhal ih ton ciar dingah relcat ciami, Thihnak ah i thlenpi tum a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zaangfahnak dil dah ti lo, zianghman a ti thei nawn lotu, A thinlung le a taksa a siat ṭheh zo mipa cu ziangah so na do duh rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harsatnak a tongtu hnenah ka ṭap ih, Mi tlasam hrangah ka riah a sia, a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungawinak le tleunak ka ruahsan mi an si naón, Vansaannak le thimnak riangri an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thinlung cu donharnak le natnak thawn a buai nasa, Nitinte tuarharnak in i tlun sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Natnak ka tuar ih ka dum ṭheh, Tleunak malte hman ka ngah lo; Misenpi hmaiah ding tahrat in bomnak ka dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka aw cu hramlak ih cinghnia le sumbuh ai bangin, Riahsia le lunglengza aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vun hmuah a dum ṭheh; Khurhnat in ka na ih ka taksa cu meisa ling in a ling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lungawinak hlasak thawm ka rak theihnak hmunah, Atu cu riahsiatnak le ṭahnak aw lawng ka thei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sual duhnak thawn fala zoh lo dingah siatcam in thu ka kam zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Van ih um Ziangkimtithei Pathian hnenin ka covo ziangso a um? Milai hnaṭuannak parah ziangtin so ro a zem hai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak a tuahtu hnenah cun Siatsuah le hlohralnak a thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in ka tuahmi hmuahhmuah a thei ṭheh, Ka ke kar khal a hmu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuphanper in ka feh dah lo; Midang bum khal ka tum dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian amah in a dikmi cuai in i thlai seh, Mawhnak ka neih lo zia kha a hmu ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dikmi lamzin in ka pial ih, Thilsual tuah duhnak in i leem ih, Sualnak in ka kut ka borhhlawhter a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lo rawl siat ṭheh sehla, Ka cinmi rawl cu midang in ei ṭheh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka innhnen pa ih nupi cu mawi in ka hmu ih, A inn sangka lengah relh in ka bawh a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nupi in mipa dang hrang rawl suang sehla, Mipa dang in a ihkhun ah ihpi seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cubangtuk sualnak cu a siava mi a si ruangah daan vekin cawhkuan pek ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cubangtuk sualnak cu ka neih cia mi hmuahhmuah a kang ṭhehtu Hell meisa bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hnen-um pakhatkhat ka parah lungkim loin a phunzai a si ahcun, A simmi ṭhatein ka ngaihsak ding, Cule diktein a parah ka nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiih ka tuah lo asile, Pathian hmai ka zoh ngam ding maw? Ka thu ṭhen ding ih a rat tikah, Ziang so ka ṭong thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nu pum sungih i siamtu Pathian cu, Ka siahhlawh pawl a siamtu Pathian thotho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mifarah bawm ding ka el dah lo; Nuhmei pawl khal riahsia in ka ret dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei rawl ka ei laiah ngakṭah farah rilrawng in ka umter dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An hnenah pa bangtuk in ka um ih, Ka nun sung ṭhatein ka kilkhawi hai a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tlasam zet ka hmu ih an farah tuk ruangah hruk ding hnipuan hman an lei thei lo a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tuurual ihsin ka lakmi tuuhmul hnipuan ka pe ṭheu. Cutin ka parah an lung a awizet ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuṭhennak hmunah ka neh ding ti thei in, Ngakṭah farah ka bum a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka baan kiak ṭheh sehla, Ka liang ihsin tlongthluh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian ih cawhkuan pek ka ṭih ruangah, Cubangtuk thil ṭha lo cu ka tuah dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sui parah ka rinsannak ka re lo, Sui ṭha bik khal ka ring cuang lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi neinung ka si ruangah ka puar dah lo; Lennak tampi ka khawm ruangah ka puarthau dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tleu-aw tiah ni ka bia dah lo; A mawi-aw tiah thlapi hmaiah ka kun dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cubangtuk sualnak tuah dingah thlemnak ka tong dah keel lo; Anmah upatnak ah ka kut zaphak khal ka hnam dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuvek sualnak a tuahtu cu thah tlak a si; Ziangahtile Pathian a dungtun ih a hnong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ral pawl harsatnak an tuar tikah ka lung a awi lo; Siatsuahnak an ton tik khalah ka di a riam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An thihnak ding siatcam thlacam in ka sual dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka hrangih hnaṭuantu pawl in Mikhual pawl ka inn ih ka tlunter cu an thei ṭheh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sukso tawivak pawl ka inn ah ka riahter ih, Lamzin ah ka itter dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midang cun an sual an thup tum; Asinain kei cu ka sualnak ka thup dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipi in ziangtin in rel ding ti ka phang dah lo; In hnihsan pang ding ti phang in innsung khalah ka khum-aw dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka ṭong hi zotal in in ngai lo ding maw? Siatcam in ka kam: Ka thusimmi hi kam khat hman a dik lo a um lo. Ziangkimtithei Pathian in i sawnseh. I raltu pawl in mawh in phurhnak cu Ka hmuh dingah ngan suak thei hai sehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmaihngal zetin ka liangah ka pu ding ih, Sui lukhuh bangin ka lu ah ka khum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathian hnenah ka tuah mi hmuahhmuah ka sim ṭheh ding; A mithmai ah hngalzet in ka um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka thlawhmi lo in i mawhthluk ih, Riahsia in a mitthli ka tlakter a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A khomi rawl ka ei ih, Lo a thlotu sawn rilrawng ih ka ret a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka lo ah sangvut le fang ai ah Hrampi le hling kho sawnseh. Job ih ṭong cu cutiin a cemta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job ih rualpi pathum in Job cu an sawn duh nawn lo, ziangahtile mawh nei lo ah a ruat aw tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutiin Job cu miding ah a ret-aw ih Pathian a mawhthluk ruangah an kiangih a dingtu Elihu an timi pa cu a thin a rak hengzet ih a suup aw thei nawn lo. (Elihu cu Ram hrin a si mi Buz tesinfa Barakel ih fapa a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elihu cu Job rualpi pathum par khalah a thin a heng, ziangahtile Job ih ṭong an leh thei lo ruangah Pathian a palh a si, ti thawn a bang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elihu cu nauta bik a si ruangah midang an ṭong a cem hlan lo daitein a rak um meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain a rualpi pathum in Job thu an leh thei lo tikah a thin a ṭeu ih hiti in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei cu nauhak ka si ih nannih cu upa nan si; Curuangah kei ka ruahmi hun sim ding hi ka hreh zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nannih ṭong hmaisa ding nan si, Upa deuh in nan fimnak in ṭawm ding nan si, tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain minung hnenah ra in fimnak in petu cu, Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih thlarau a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minung cu an tar ruangah an fim a si lo ih, Thudik khal an thei a si cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah i ngai ve hnik uh ti ka duh, Ka ruahmi ka lo sim ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan ṭong sung hmuahhmuah kha thin sau zetin ka rak ngai, Fimnak ṭongkam nan hawl rero laiah ka lo hngak ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhatein ka lo ngai ih nan neh lo a si ti ka thei. Job ih a ṭongmi pawl nan el thei lo a sihi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangtin so fimnak neitu kan si tiah nan ti ngam? Job a sawn theitu cu Pathian a si, Nannih cun nan ti thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job cu nan hnenah a ṭong, ka hnenah a ṭong lo; Asinain a thu nan leh vek cun ka let dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Job, ṭong ding an thei nawn lo; Na thu an lo sawn thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Daite ih an um tiang maw ka hngah ding? Ṭong ding zianghman nei nawn loin an ding meen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asilo, keimah in atu ah ka lo sawn ding; Ka ruahnak ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ṭong loin ka um thei nawn lo, Ka sungah ka ṭong dingmi a khat tuk thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ṭongnak tikcu ka neih lo asile sabitti thar a khatmi saphaw thawl a kuai vekin ka puak kuai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ṭong hrimhrim a ṭul a si, Cuti lawngin ka thaw a suak ding; Ka kaa in ka simsuak hrimhrim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi thu ah zohman ṭan cuangmi ka nei lo ding; Zohman ka porh hlei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi porh khal ka thiam lo; Mi ka porh asile hmakhatte ah Pathian in i hrem ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Curuangah Job, ka ṭong dingmi hmuahhmuah hi ṭhatein ngaihnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thinlung ih a ummi ka hmurka in a suak ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ṭongmi hmuahhmuah hi ka thinlung ih ummi thungai an si; Felte in ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ih thlarau in i tuah ih, Ziangkimtithei ih thaw in nunnak i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I let hnik, i leh thei asile, Na ṭong dingmi cu ruat hnik! Ka hmaiah ding in ṭang hnih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang le kei cu Pathian hmaiah kan bangrep. Kan pahnih in tlaklei ih tuahmi kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah i ṭih duh hlah; Ka lo neh-nen ciamco lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ṭong ka theih mi cu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mawhnak ka nei lo, thilṭha lo zianghman ka tuah lo; Mawh nei lo ka si ih sualnak in ka luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain Pathian in i do duh ruangah thu a hawl ih, a ral vekah i tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ke thir cikcin in a ṭeem ih Ka ke kar hmuahhmuah tla a zohhliah a si,” na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Job, fiangtein ka lo sim: Na palh a si! Pathian cu zovek milai hnak hman in a tumsawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangah so milai ih phunzainak a sawn dah lo tiah, Pathian cu na mawhthluk rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian cu milai hnenah atu le atu a ṭong, Asinain a ṭongmi cu zianghman ah an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Milai an itthat lai, an mang ah Mang le langnak in an hnenah a ṭong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ṭongmi ngai dingah an hna a ongter ih a sim, Ralrinnak a simmi kha an ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sualnak tuah nawn lo dingah le Mi puarthau si nawn lo dingin a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlankhur sung a thlenter hai lo; Thihnak ihsin a run hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in milai nun a sim tikah natnak a tuarter, An taksa pumpi in natnak a tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dam lo pawl cun rawl ei an hiar lo; Rawl thaw bik hman an luak a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An taksa a cem deuhdeuh ih An ruh lawng a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlankhur an pan deuhdeuh, Mithi khua an thleng cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Milai ṭuanvo simfiangtu dingah, Pathian vancungmi thawng tampi lakah pakhat tal, Cuih milai bawm ding le a dikmi sim dingah a ra meen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vancungmi in zaangfahnak thinlung thawn, “Anih kha cu thlah uh! Mithi khua ih feh dingmi a si lo; Amah tlennak man hinah a um,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutiin a taksa cu a no ding ih a cak sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thla a cam tikah Pathian in a let ding, Lungawi in Pathian a bia ding ih, Pathian in a hrangah ziang hmuahhmuah a tluangter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule anih in misenpi hmaiah, “Ka sual a si, a dik lo ka tuah, Asinain Pathian in ka nunnak i zuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlankhur feh ding i siang loih Sun khawtleu ka hmu hrih a si,” a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutiin Pathian in atu le atu hna a ṭuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi nunnak cu thlankhur thleng loin a run ih, A san sungah lungawinak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah Job, ka lo sim mi hi ngai aw; Daite in um awla ka ṭong hrih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain thusim ding na neih asile sim aw, ka ngai ding; Lungawite in na dik a si ka ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuti a si lo ahcun daitein um awla i ngai aw; Fimnak thu ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nannih mifim le thuthei pawl, Ka thusimmi hi ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rawl cu nan tep ih a thawt le thawt lo nan thei; Nan hna in thu nan thei ih thudik a si le si lo nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thu cu thudik a si le si lo kan hril pei; Thu ṭha a si le si lo khal kan ruat hnik pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Job in, “Mawhnak ka nei lo; Ka parah Pathian in dingtein thu a ṭhen lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangtin so ka mawh ngai a si, tiah thuphan cu ka rel thei ding? Ka hma hi dam thei sal ding rual a si lo, Asinain sualnak cu ka nei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Job vek milai nan hmu dah maw? Pathian hmuhsuamnak cu ol tein a rel; A hrangah cun tidai in tluk in a ol a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl thawn pawl awk a duh ih, Misual pawl thawn an feh tlang ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih rualpi ṭha si hi Zianghman ṭhathnemnak a um lo, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nannih theihthiamnak a nei pawl I ngai uh! Pathian in thil ṭha lo a tuah ding maw? Ziangkimtithei in thil sual a tuah ngai ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Milai cu an hnaṭuan thawn kaih-aw in hlawhman Pathian in a pek, An tuahmi ziaza thawn mil-aw in an parah a thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian cu zo ih par hmanah a ding lomi a tuah lo; Zokhal bangraan tein a zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midang zotal in Pathian hnenah thuneihnak an pe maw? Leilung pumpi hi kil aw, tiah zotal in ṭuanvo an pe maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in a thlarau a lak ih nunnak thaw a lak kir a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunnak nei mi hmuahhmuah hi an thi ding ih, Minung hi leivut ah a cang sal ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimnak nan neih ngaingai a si ahcun i ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dingmi le a nasami Pathian nan hnong a si maw? Pathian in thudik a hua, sisehla ziangtinso leilung a uk thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in siangpahrang le hotu pawl a hnong, Santlai lo le mi ṭha lo an si ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in mi hmuahhmuah a tuah, Zohman a thleidang lo; Uktu bawi a ṭan loih mifarah hua in milian a duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milai cu rinlopi in zanah an thi thei; Pathian in a vuakthluk ih an hlota. Micak zet khal ziangtitham loin a cemter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in minung lamzin a zoh, Milai ih ke kar cu a zohhliah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziangvek thimnak a si khalle misual hmu lo dingin Pathian a phen theitu thimnak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian hmaiah milai feh tahrat in a thu ṭhen dingah, Pathian in tikcu khiah a ṭul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hotu pawl hnong tahratin hotu dang re dingah, Pathian in an thu zingzoi rero ta a ṭul lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziangahtile an tuahmi fate bik khal a thei ṭheh; Zan ah a hlon hai ih a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Misenpi hmuh theinak hmunah misual pawl a hrem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ziangahtile amah an thlun duh nawn lo ih, A thukham hmuahhmuah tla an poisa nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anmah pawl in mifarah an tisiat ruangah an hui ih an ṭap; Mifarah pawl ih bom dilnak aw cu Pathian in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in umsan meen dingih a ruah ahcun, Zoin so an mawhthluk thei ding? A hmai a thuh ahcun milai in ziangso an ti thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anmah uktu ah Pathian thei lo, mi-neh-nen hmang ret hman sehla, Ram sungmi pawl in ziangso an ti thei cuang ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Job, Pathian hnenah na sualnak na phuang zo maw? Sual nawn lo dingin thu na kam-aw zo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka mawhnak i hmuh hram aw, tiah na dil maw? Thil ṭha lo tuah nawn lo dingin na lung a kim zo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian ih hnaṭuannak na soisel zo hnuah, Na duhmi lo tuahsak dingah na beisei lai mawsi? Hi thu cu nangmah ruahcat ding a si, Kei ih ruahcat ding a si lo! Atu-ah na ruahnak in sim hnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thu a ruat thei pawl cu an lung a kim ko ding; Ka thusimmi a theitu mifim pawl an ti ve ko ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Job hi thuhla thei ngah loin a rak ṭong pang a sihi! A ṭong mi hi sullam a rak nei lo a sihi! an ti ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Job ih ṭong hi ṭhateih nan ruat a si ahcun, Miṭha lo pakhat vekin a ṭong a si, ti nan hmu ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sualnak ih tlunah dodalnak a beet ih, Kan mithmuh le kan hna theih ah Pathian a hnihsan, a hmuhsuam a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, nang in, “Pathian hmaiah mawhnak ka nei lo,” na ti hi a dikmi a si tiah na ruat mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka sual lonak hin ziangso i ṭhathnempi? Sual ningla teh kei hrangah ziang so a sawt cuang?” tiah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah siseh, na rualpi pawl siseh Keimah in thu ka lo let ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van khi hun zohhnik! Khawdur tla khi hun zohhnik! Ziangtluk in so nang hnakin an saan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sual a si hmanah Pathian cu harsatnak a pe lo. Thilsual voi tampi na tuah hmanah Pathian cu a hnaihnok lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na dingfel ruangah Pathian ka bawm tiah na ruat mawsi? Na hnen ihsin Pathian ih haimi zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na sual ruangih a tuartu cu nangmah ih rualpi an si. Na ṭhatnak ih a bommi cu anmah thotho an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milai cu hremnak an tuar tikah an hui an aihram ṭheu; Runtu pakhatkhat hnenah runnak duh ah an dil ih an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla harnak caan ngaingai a thleng ih anmah thazaang a petu, Anmah Siamtu Pathian cu an hoih duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ramsa le vate hnakin fimvar deuh ih in tuahtu, Pathian cu an pan duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bomnak duh ah an au, an ṭap, Asinain Pathian in a sawn hai lo; Miṭha lo le mihngal an si ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An au rero man a um lo, Ziangkimtithei Pathian in a hmu lo; A theih khal a thei hai lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job, nang cun Pathian ka hmu lo na ti; Asinain thinsau zetin hngak aw, Na thuhla a hmaiah a thleng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian ih thinhengnak in mi a hrem lo, Sualnak khal a poisa lo, tiah na ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sullam nei loin na ṭong men, Na ṭong reromi ih tican ziang a si ti zianghman na thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu in a thu hiti in a zom sal:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ai-awh in ka ṭongmi hi Thinsau in rei deuh ngai hrih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Siamtu Pathian hi a ding a si ti langternak ah, Ka thutheihnak a kim nasami hi ka theih tawkin ka hmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hnenih ka ṭongmi hi a dik lomi a um lo; Na hmaiah mifim taktak cu a um ih na hmu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian cu a maksak ngaingai ih hmuhsuam mi a nei lo; Theih lomi khal a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Misual pawl cu a zuah lo; Mifarah pawl thu cu dingtein a relsak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miding pawl cu a hum; Siangpahrang vekin mi uktu ah a tuah ih, Kumkhua in sunlawi upatnak a coter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla milai in anmah ih thil tuahnak ruangah, Zonzaihnak an tuar ih cikcin ih ṭemṭawnnak an ton ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in an sualnak le an puarthaunak an hnenah a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhatlonak ihsin kir sal dingah an hna a ongter ih ralrinnak thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thu an thlun ih amah an rian a si ahcun, An nundam sungah hnangamnak le neihnunnak an dong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian thu an thlun lo ahcun ralnam in a siatsuah hai ding ih, Zianghman thei loin an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian thei lo pawl cu an thin a ṭeu ringring; Harsatnak an ton hmanah bomnak dil in thla an cam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An san ṭhat laiah an thi ih An nunnak cu ningzahnak in a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in minung cu an harsat tuarnak sungin a run ih, Harsatnak cu an mit vangtertu ah a vanter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in harsatnak sungin a lo suah ih, Himnak sungah nuamzetin a lo ret; Na cabuai cu eiding rawl in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain atu-ah miṭha lo pawl ih an tuar ṭheumi hremnak na tuar; Na sualnak thawn mil-aw in na tuar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ralring aw! Nawhthuh ei-nak in lo bum hlah seh, Lennak in lo hruaisual hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bomnak duh ah na au rero khalle a ṭhahnem lo ding, Thazaang na neih mi hmuahhmuah in a lo bawm thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zan a ra thlen dingmi cu hngakhlap duh hlah; Miphun tampi an hlohralnak tikcu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ṭha lomi lamah feh hlah; Culam hoi lo dingin a lo khamtu dingah harsat tuarnak tontermi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian ih huham a tumzia cu cing ringring aw; Pathian cu zirhtu saya ṭha bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zohman in Pathian cu hnaṭuan an fial thei lo ding, Thilsual tuah tla an puh thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian cu a thil tuahmi ruangah an thangṭhat ringring; Nannih khal in amah cu nan thangṭhat ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu zokhal in an hmu zo, Asinain lamhlapi lawngin kan cuan thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian ih maksakzia cu kan thei kim dah lo; Pathian ih kum khal siarcawk rual a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leilung ih tidai la tahrat in Vanruah ih a sur tertu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlaici cingtu milai hmuahhmuah hrangah Pathian in, Khawdur ihsin ruah a surter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian umnak vanah ziangvekin khawdur a feh tile, Ziangtin khua a ri durdo ti zohman in an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah in vanrang deng tiang nimthla a kauter, Asinain tifinriat ih tawdeng cu a thim thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutiin amah in ruah a surter ih milai a cawm hai; An ei ding rawl tampi a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimthlakau a kut in a huam ih, A hmuitin ngah dingin ṭektla cu thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thlisia a rat ding kha khawri in a than; Cawrual khal in a rat ding cu an thei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thlisia le ruahhrang in nasazet in ka thin an khurter,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan zatein Pathian ih aw thawm ngai uh, A kaa sung ihsin a suakmi khawri thawm cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van ahl nimthlakau khuazakip ah a thlah; Leilung kilkip ah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule a awkhawk cu kan thei; A nasa zetmi khawri cu a thang durdo; Culai ah nimthlakau cu cat loin a tleu zohzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ih thupek in mangbangza thil a cang, Kan theih ban lomi khawruahhar thil pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leilung parah vur tla dingin thu a pek; A thupek vekin ruahpi vanbong in a sur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnaṭuantu milai pawl a cawlter, Ziangbangtuk hna a ṭuan thei ti kha theihter a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramsa pawl an puuk ah an lut, An kua ah an lut ih an kual.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlisia cu thlanglam in a hung hrang, Khawsik cu saklam in a rung thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ih thaw in tidai a khangter, Cule a hak zetmi tikhal ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawdur lakah tidai a ret, Nimthlakau an tleu zohzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian thu an thlun ih leilung kilkip an kap zukzo, Pathian ih thupek bangtuk in an um ṭheh, Leilung pumpi khuazakip ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in leilung ciar dingah ruah a surter; Milai hremnak ah maw, Asilole a lungkimnak langternak ah maw, ruah cu a surter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job, malte sung cawlta awla ngaihnik, Pathian ih thil mangbangza a tuah mi hi ruat hnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangtin Pathian in thu a pek ih Khawdur ihsin nimthlakau a tleu zohzo ti na thei thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawdur cu vanah ziangtin a thawn luailo ti na thei maw? Pathian ih thil thiam zia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sim thli a hung hran ih leilung a sat tikah, Na hnipuan le na thawsa thawn na tuar cuahco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in van khi a pharh ih, Thlalang vek hak in a tuah tikah, Nang na bawm theimi ziang a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian hnenih kan ṭong dingmi in sim hnik, Kan thu ah ṭong ding kan nei lo, Kan thinlung ah zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ṭong ding hi Pathian dilta ka ṭul mawsi? Pathian ih siatsuah ding cu mi in ziangah so an hril rero ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Van ih tleunak cu a tle nasa, A tleu tukih kan zoh ngam lo; Van cu thli in a sem fai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saklam in sui vekih a tleumi a lang, Pathian sunlawinak maktara thawn kan thinlung cu a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian ih huham a nasa tuk ih kan naih ngam lo; Dingzet le felzet in minung hnen ah thu a rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in an ṭih hi an mawh lo; Ka fim a ti-awtu pawl cu Pathian in zianghman ah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule phusiing sung ihsin Bawipa cu Job hnenah a ṭong. Bawipa in hiti in a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zoso na si, ka fimnak thu a el ṭohṭotu cu? Theihnak nei lopi in na tlok rero ve cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pacang vekin na timtuah in ding awla, Thu ka lo suh dingmi pawl hi i let hnik aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung ka rak seemsuah laiah nang khuiah na um? Thu na theizet ngai a si ahcun i sim hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung hi ziangtia a si ding ti a relcattu zoso a si? A tlunih ramri tahnak zoso a zam? Na theimi a um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leilung a hun dotu ṭhuam pawl ziang parah so an din? Zo in so a kilphum lung a phum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih ni khawfingcat ah arsi pawl hmun khatah hla an sak; Vanmi pawl cu lungawi in, an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung pum sung ihsin tifinriat a rak suah laiah, A khamtu ding kotka zo in so a rak khar?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tifinriat kha khawdur in a khuhtu le, Thimnak in a tuamtu cu Keimah ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tifinriat hrangah ramri ka tuah ih, Kalhmi kotka sungah ka ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hi tiang lawng ra awla, hi hlei na feh thei lo; A cak zetmi na tilet pawl hinah an cawl pei!” tiah tipi cu ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Job, na nun sungah ni khatkhat, ‘Khua vaang thlang aw’ na ti dah maw? ‘Khawfing cat thlang aw’ tiah thu na pe dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawfingcat in leilung tlet dingah le, Miṭha lo pawl an relhnak hmunih va hnin suak dingah thu na pe dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitlang in tlang le horkuam pawl fiangtein a langter, Puan buh mi bangin le tlak parih hmin ngannak hminkhen mi bangin a langfiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sun nitleu cu miṭha lo hrangah a tleu tuk ih, Thisen luanter ding a kham a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tifinriat tawdeng ih tipuutnak na thleng dah maw? Tipithuanthum tawdeng ah lam na leng dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thimzet mithi khua ih kotka le A kiltu pawl zo in an lo hmuh dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leilung hi ziangtia a si ti na thei maw? Na theih asile i sim hnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tleunak hi khuitawk in a ra ti na thei maw? Thimnak teh khuiinso a suah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An fehnak ding lamzin le An kirnak ding hmun na sim thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na tarzet thlang ih leilung a seem lai ih Na rak suak zo a si ahcun na sim thei ding ka zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vur le rial ka retnak khaan na pal dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Harsatnak tikcu caan hrang le Ral awknak le do awknak caan hrangah ka ret a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni a hung suahnak hmun khi na thleng dah maw? Asilole nisuahnak lam thli a rat nak na pal dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruah ti luannak horkuam cu zo in so a hriat? Khawri le thlisia hrangah zo in so lamzin a sial?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Milai um lonak hmun thlaler ramṭhing ah zoso ruah a surter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hrampi hring kho hai seh tiah Ramro le ramcaar zo in so tidai a toih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruah in pa a nei maw? Daitla in hringtu a nei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zo ih pum sung ah so vur a seem? Zo ih pum sung inso tikhal a suah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zoin so tidai cu lungto vekah a canter ih, Tifinriat ih hmai cu a khangter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siruk rawlṭawm khi hmun khatah na ṭem thei ding maw? Likhuk caang thum ṭemnak hri na phoih thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Arsi anmah le an caan ciar ih Suak dingin na fial thei ding maw? Ngambawm le zawltling khi lamzin na hmuh thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Van ih a ummi thil pawl thlunmi daan umzia na thei maw? Leilung ahhin thu na run neihter thei pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawdur khi, “Ruah in i run surh aw” tiah na fial thei pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimthlakau khi thu pe cila, anih in, “Na thu vekin siseh,” a lo ti ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zoin so ciinphung vate cu ti a lian ding tiah a simter? Zoin so butlak cu ruah a sur ding tiah a thanter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zoin so khawdur siar thei tlak in a fim? Zoso tidai run thle dingah van tikuang khi thu a pe thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khawdur ihsin ruah a sur tikah Zoso leivut pawl a erh awkter ih leilung cu thir bangin a hakter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kiosa pawl rawl ei ding na hawl sak maw? Kiosa no rilrawng pawl an pum na puarter maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kiosa note tla an kua sungah an um ih lungpuk sungih an relh laiah zo in so rawl a pek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tlang-ak rilrawng in an vak ih An faate tla rawl duh ah ka hnen an ai tikah zo in so rawl a pek?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ziangtikah khaamlak zaathar in faate an nei ti na thei maw? Zukneng ih faate hrin lai na hmu dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An faate thlaziat an pai ti na thei maw? Ziangtikah an hring ding ti na sim thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangtikah so a nu a bok ding ih a pum sungin a suah ding ih, Leilung a thlen ding ti na thei thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An faate pawl cu hramlak ah an tlang ih an cakzet; Anmah ih duhnak ah an feh ih an nu hnenah an kir sal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hramlak laak cu zo in so duh tawkih tlan theinak thu a pek? Zoin so a thlah ih an duhnak ah a vakter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Milai umlonak nelrawn ramṭhing kha an inn ah ka pek ih, Hrampi umlonak cite hmunrawn ah ka umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thawmvang tamnak khawpi sungah cun an um duh lo; Zohman in hrem tahrat in hna an ṭuanter thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlangpar cu an hrampi piatnak hmun a si; Ei dingah a hring pohpoh an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sele in na hna a lo ṭuansak duh ding maw? Na caw inn ah zankhat hman a riak duh ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hridai in khit tahratin lei na letter thei ding maw? Leileh cia mi rawnrual seh, tiah leirual ternak na dirter thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khunghar na hna ṭuantu dingah, A cahnak na rinsan thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na fang ciilnak puum ah a ra kir sal ding tiah na zum maw? Na puum ah thlairawl na khawmter thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kalauk vate ih thlakhawn cu ziangtlukinso a zamrang? Asinain ziangvek kalauk vate khal ngathur vek cun a zuang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kalauk vate in a ti cu leilung parah a taan; Leilung ih hlumter dingah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi in an pal kuai pang ding, tile ramsa khal in an ciilkuai pang ding, ti a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A faate pawl cu amah ih fa lo vekin a tuah; A zonzaihnak cu a lak a si ding ti a poisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiti vekih a aattertu le fimnak a pe lotu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nasa zetih a tlan cengmang ahcun, Rang le rangtotu hman a titham lo ih a hnihsan meen a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Job, rang a caktertu cu nang na si maw? A tuanghmul fualzet ih a khotertu cu nang na si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kharbok vekih an khir hi nang in maw na khirter? Mi an hro ih an hnar an phiit khi nang in maw na phiitter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thatho zetin phairawn ah an ke an tiim; Raldonak hmunah an tha neih tawp in an nor.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭih khal an nei loih ziangvek ralnam hman in a khir thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rangtotu ih an kenmi hriamnam: Conkiang bawm, feipi le nam pawl an khawng-aw ih nisa ah an tle zohzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Raldonak tawtawrawt an tum cun daitein an um thei nawn lo; An tha a tho ih hmaiah an tlan vurvo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawtawrawt an tumtin in an hnar an phiit; Raldonak rim lamhlat in an thei, Ralkap hotu bawi ih thupeknak aw khal an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khaute cu na hnen in mawsi zuan a zir? Thlanglam zuan ding ih a thla a pharh tikah khan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Muvanlai in na thu a ngai mawsi? Tlangsang parih bu a sak tikah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungkham saangbikah bu a tuah ih Lunghriam le lungzum pawl a ralhruang ah a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin thah ding le ei ding kha, A hlat a nai ah a thlir ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saruak umnak ah langta an khawm aw, A thii cu an fano pawl in an dawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, Ziangkimtithei Pathian cu na engtai a si, Dung na siip ding maw, a thu na let ding so?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aatthlakza in ka ṭong zo, Bawipa, Kei in ziangso ka lo leh thei ding? Zianghman ka ṭong nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ṭong dingzat hnakih tam ka ṭong zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in phusiing sungin Job hnenah hiti in a let:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Job, pacang bangin ding awla, Ka thusuhmi pawl i let hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ding lo ah i tuah tum mawsi? Kei hi misual ah re tahratin, Nang sawn a dikmi ah na ruat-aw tum mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang, keimah tlukin na cak maw? Na aw teh keimah ih aw khawri vekin a ring maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuti asile hminthannak le hmaihngalnak na neih mi thawn ding aw; Sunlawinak le huham na neih mi thawn thuam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl zoh hai aw; Na thinhengnak suah nasa awla an ningzak koin tuahhnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asi, zoh awla ṭhum hai hnik aw; Miṭha lo pawl cu an dinnak hmunah ciil ciammam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leilung sungah phum ṭheh aw; Mithi ramah hreng hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiin na tuah thei asile A lo thangṭhat hmaisa biktu cu Keimah ka si ding. Nangmah in i neh a si, ka ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahrang Behemoth khi zohhnik; Nangmah ka lo tuah vekin anih khal ka tuah. Cawcang bangin hrampi a piat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain ziangtluk thazaang cak so a ruangpi ah a um? Ziangvek cahnak so a taksa ah a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mei cu sidar thingkung bangin a khoh, A kawng tha tla a cak ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ruh cu dar bangin a khoh, A ke tla cu thir tluan a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka sersiammi hmuahhmuah lakah mangbangza bik ramsa a si; Amah nehtu cu amah siamtu lawng a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sahrang an tlannak tlangsaang ah, A rawl ding hrampi a kho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlingkung hnuai ah a bok; Cirhduup ih phaipheng lakah a relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tivakap ih hlingkung le partiam kung in daihnem an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tilian hman a ṭih lo; Jordan tisuar in a hmai deeng rero hmansehla daitein a um meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zoin so a mit hup tahratin a kai thei ding? Zoin so a hnar ihsin sio in a awk thei ding?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tisung sahrang Leviathan cu sio in na awk thei ding maw? A lei cu hridai in na khit thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnar vit in hri na thluah thei ding maw? Siopi in a khabe na dawttlang thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘I thlah hram aw,’ a lo ti ding maw? Zaangfah a lo dil ding mawsi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah thawn lungkimnak tuah in Kumkhua lo rian dingah thu a lo kam ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hnenum nunau pawl ih zoh nuam ah, Na innzuat vate bangin na khit thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sa zuar duh ah ngakaitu pawl an neep-aw rero ding maw? Sumtuah pawl in zuar dingah a sa an can ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vun cu feipi in na dawttlang thei ding maw? A lu cu hridai thluah mi fei in na sun thei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kut in hun dai hnik; Nan sual aw nasa ding; Neh hnuah na ti ngam nawn zik lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leviathan cu an hmuh meen hmanah An ṭih tuk ih leilung ah an ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ai a thawh cun ṭihnungza ngaingai a si; A hmai ih ding ngamtu zohman an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leviathan a do ih a him thei an um pei maw? Lei tlunah zohman an um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leviathan ih kebeu tha le, a thahrum cahzia thuhla sim loin ka um meen thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zohman in a hrukmi a korleng cu an hlit thei lo ding; A thir angki khal an suntlang thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zoso a khabe a bauh thei ding: ṭihnungza a hatian pawl thawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zaangtluan ih kep cu ralphaw tampi thuah bangin, An thuah aw ṭhepṭhep ih lungto vekin a hak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat an peh awknak a pit tuk ih, Thli hman a lut thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnget tukin an peh-aw ih Zianghman in a dircat thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hahthio tikah tleunak a suak zohzo; A mit cu zingpit nisuak bangin a tle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kaa sungin mei alh an suak zohzo ih, Meici tla an ṭek hluahhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnar sung in meikhu a suak; A tlok hluahhlo mi beel hnuai ih hrampi kang khu bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thaw in meisa a alhter ih A kaa sungin meivam a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hngawng cu a cah tukah, A tongtu hmuahhmuah in an ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vun nemnak zawn khui hmanah a um lo, Thir vekin a hak ih a kiak thei ding rual a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thinlung cu lungto vekin a ruh ih ṭih a nei lo; A hakmi le a kuai thei lomi fang rialnak lungto vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A hung thawh tikah a cak bik pawl hman in an ṭih; Thinphang in an lung a hlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hlen theitu ralnam a um lo; A sun pem theitu fei le thal zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hrangah thir cu fangkung ro vek a si; Dar cu thing rop vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Conkiang hman in a dawitlanter thei lo; Lungto ih deen khalle a hrangah hramro vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Talhtum cu a hrangah phaipheng kung vek a si; Feipi in an khawh tik khalah a hnihsan meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A pum vun cu hlamphei hriam a bang. A feh phah ah a ciarmi leilung cu leilet bangin a hrutbal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ukang sung tiso bangin tifinriat cu a soter; Siti beel liam bangin tipi cu a liamter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A feh tikah a dunglam ih tidai cu a tleu zurzo; Tifinriat cu a phuulter ih tibuanra ah a canter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leilung tlunah amah thawn ṭhim ding an um lo; ṭihnak zianghman nei lo ramsa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A puarthau bik ramsa pawl hman ziangah a siar lo; Hramlak ramsa hmuahhmuah ih siangpahrang a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Job in Bawipa cu hiti in a let:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa , nang cu ziangtinkim titheitu na si, Na duhmi hmuahhmuah cu na tuah thei ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Zianghman theilopi in ka fimnak na zo ihnit ngam mawsi?’ tiah i sut. Asi, ka theih lomi thu tampi ka ṭong, Ka theih ban lomi mangbangza thu ka rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ka ṭongmi ngai awla ka thusuh mi i let aw?’ tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Culai ahcun ka hna lawngin ka lo thei; Atu-ah cun ka mit rori in ka lo hmu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah ningzak in ka fih aw ih, Leivut le vutcam lakah to in ka siir-aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in hi hmuahhmuah Job hnenih a ṭong hnuah Elifas hnenah, “Nangmah le na rualpi pahnih parah ka thin a heng, ziangahtile ka siahhlawh Job cun ka thuhla hi dik zetin a sim naón nannih cun nan sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Job hnenah cawcang pasarih le tuucang pasarih in hei keng uhla nan hrangah thawinak va pe uh. Job in nan hrangah thla a cam ding ih a thlacamnak cu ka ngai ding ih nan aat tluk in mual ka lo photer lo ding. Amah vekin ka thuhla dik zetin nan sim lo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih a fial vekin Elifas, Bildad le Zofar cun an tuah ih Bawipa in Job ih thlacamnak cu a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Job in a rualpi pathum hrangih thla a cam hnuah, Bawipa in amah cu a tungding sal ih a hlanih a neihmi hmuahhmuah ih lethnih tam in a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A unau pawl a farnu pawl le a rualpi hlun pawl an ra leng ih a inn ah rawl ei puai an tuah. Pathian in a parah harsatnak a thlenter ruangah an zaangfahnak le an hnemnak thu an sim. Tangka le sui zunghruk pakhat fingfing an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Job cu a netsan ah a hlan hnakih tam sinsin in thlawsuah a pek. Job in tuu thawng hleili, kalauk thawng ruk, cawcang khuah thawng khat le laak thawng khat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fapa pasarih le fanu pathum a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fanu upa bik cu Jemimah a ti ih a pahnihnak cu Keziah a ti ih a nauta bik cu Keren Happuk a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Job fanu pawl vekih a mawimi leilung tlunah nunau zohman an um lo. An pa in a fapa pawl ro a zem vekin a fanu pawl khal a zem ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Job cu kum za le sawmli a nung ih a tu le a fa pawl sanli tiang a hmu hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum tamzet a nung ih tarkuun in a thi.
  </para>
</usx>
